#: src/cargo.md
msgid ""
"When you start reading about Rust, you will soon meet "
"[Cargo](https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/), the standard tool used in the "
"Rust ecosystem to build and run Rust applications. Here we want to give a "
"brief overview of what Cargo is and how it fits into the wider ecosystem and"
" how it fits into this training."
msgstr ""
"Saat mulai membaca tentang Rust, Anda akan segera mengenal "
"[Cargo](https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/), tool standar dalam ekosistem Rust"
" untuk melakukan build dan menjalankan aplikasi Rust. Di sini, kami "
"memberikan gambaran singkat tentang Cargo, perannya dalam ekosistem yang "
"lebih luas, dan penggunaannya dalam pelatihan ini."

#: src/cargo.md
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Instalasi"

#: src/cargo.md
msgid "**Please follow the instructions on <https://rustup.rs/>.**"
msgstr "**Silakan ikuti petunjuk di <https://rustup.rs/>.**"

#: src/cargo.md
msgid ""
"This will give you the Cargo build tool (`cargo`) and the Rust compiler "
"(`rustc`). You will also get `rustup`, a command line utility that you can "
"use to install different compiler versions."
msgstr ""
"Anda akan memperoleh tool build Cargo (`cargo`) dan compiler Rust (`rustc`)."
" Anda juga akan mendapatkan `rustup`, utilitas command-line untuk memasang "
"berbagai versi compiler."

#: src/cargo.md
msgid ""
"After installing Rust, you should configure your editor or IDE to work with "
"Rust. Most editors do this by talking to [rust-analyzer](https://rust-"
"analyzer.github.io/), which provides auto-completion and jump-to-definition "
"functionality for [VS Code](https://code.visualstudio.com/), "
"[Emacs](https://rust-analyzer.github.io/manual.html#emacs), "
"[Vim/Neovim](https://rust-analyzer.github.io/manual.html#vimneovim), and "
"many others. There is also a different IDE available called "
"[RustRover](https://www.jetbrains.com/rust/)."
msgstr ""
"Setelah memasang Rust, Anda sebaiknya mengonfigurasi editor atau IDE agar "
"mendukung Rust. Sebagian besar editor melakukannya melalui [rust-"
"analyzer](https://rust-analyzer.github.io/), yang menyediakan auto-"
"completion dan jump-to-definition untuk [VS "
"Code](https://code.visualstudio.com/), [Emacs](https://rust-"
"analyzer.github.io/manual.html#emacs), [Vim/Neovim](https://rust-"
"analyzer.github.io/manual.html#vimneovim), dan banyak editor lainnya. "
"Tersedia pula IDE lain bernama [RustRover](https://www.jetbrains.com/rust/)."

#: src/cargo.md
msgid "On Debian/Ubuntu, you can install `rustup` via `apt`:"
msgstr "Pada Debian/Ubuntu, Anda dapat memasang `rustup` melalui `apt`:"

#: src/cargo.md
msgid ""
"On macOS, you can use [Homebrew](https://brew.sh/) to install Rust, but this"
" may provide an outdated version. Therefore, it is recommended to install "
"Rust from the official site."
msgstr ""
"Pada macOS, Anda dapat menggunakan [Homebrew](https://brew.sh/) untuk "
"memasang Rust, tetapi versi yang tersedia mungkin sudah lama. Karena itu, "
"Anda disarankan memasang Rust dari situs resminya."

#: src/cargo/rust-ecosystem.md
msgid "The Rust Ecosystem"
msgstr "Ekosistem Rust"

#: src/cargo/rust-ecosystem.md
msgid ""
"The Rust ecosystem consists of a number of tools, of which the main ones "
"are:"
msgstr "Ekosistem Rust terdiri atas sejumlah tool. Tool utamanya adalah:"

#: src/cargo/rust-ecosystem.md
msgid ""
"`rustc`: the Rust compiler that turns `.rs` files into binaries and other "
"intermediate formats."
msgstr ""
"`rustc`: compiler Rust yang mengubah berkas `.rs` menjadi binary dan format "
"perantara lainnya."

#: src/cargo/rust-ecosystem.md
msgid ""
"`cargo`: the Rust dependency manager and build tool. Cargo knows how to "
"download dependencies, usually hosted on <https://crates.io>, and it will "
"pass them to `rustc` when building your project. Cargo also comes with a "
"built-in test runner which is used to execute unit tests."
msgstr ""
"`cargo`: dependency manager dan tool build Rust. Cargo dapat mengunduh "
"dependency, yang biasanya tersedia di <https://crates.io>, lalu "
"meneruskannya ke `rustc` saat melakukan build proyek. Cargo juga menyediakan"
" test runner bawaan untuk menjalankan unit test."

#: src/cargo/rust-ecosystem.md
msgid ""
"`rustup`: the Rust toolchain installer and updater. This tool is used to "
"install and update `rustc` and `cargo` when new versions of Rust are "
"released. In addition, `rustup` can also download documentation for the "
"standard library. You can have multiple versions of Rust installed at once "
"and `rustup` will let you switch between them as needed."
msgstr ""
"`rustup`: tool untuk memasang dan memperbarui toolchain Rust. Tool ini "
"memasang dan memperbarui `rustc` serta `cargo` ketika versi Rust baru "
"dirilis. Selain itu, `rustup` dapat mengunduh dokumentasi standard library. "
"Anda dapat memasang beberapa versi Rust sekaligus dan beralih di antaranya "
"menggunakan `rustup` sesuai kebutuhan."

