#: src/methods-and-traits/traits/implementing.md
msgid ""
"To implement `Trait` for `Type`, you use an `impl Trait for Type { .. }` "
"block."
msgstr ""
"Untuk mengimplementasikan `Trait` bagi `Type`, gunakan block `impl Trait for"
" Type { .. }`."

#: src/methods-and-traits/traits/implementing.md
msgid ""
"Unlike Go interfaces, just having matching methods is not enough: a `Cat` "
"type with a `talk()` method would not automatically satisfy `Pet` unless it "
"is in an `impl Pet` block."
msgstr ""
"Berbeda dari interface Go, memiliki method yang cocok saja tidak cukup: tipe"
" `Cat` dengan method `talk()` tidak otomatis memenuhi `Pet` kecuali method "
"itu berada dalam block `impl Pet`."

#: src/methods-and-traits/traits/implementing.md
msgid ""
"Traits may provide default implementations of some methods. Default "
"implementations can rely on all the methods of the trait. In this case, "
"`greet` is provided, and relies on `talk`."
msgstr ""
"Trait dapat menyediakan implementasi default untuk sebagian method. "
"Implementasi default dapat mengandalkan semua method dalam trait tersebut. "
"Pada contoh ini, `greet` disediakan dan mengandalkan `talk`."

#: src/methods-and-traits/traits/implementing.md
msgid ""
"Multiple `impl` blocks are allowed for a given type. This includes both "
"inherent `impl` blocks and trait `impl` blocks. Likewise multiple traits can"
" be implemented for a given type (and often types implement many traits!). "
"`impl` blocks can even be spread across multiple modules/files."
msgstr ""
"Suatu tipe boleh memiliki beberapa block `impl`, baik inherent `impl` maupun"
" `impl` trait. Suatu tipe juga dapat mengimplementasikan beberapa trait, dan"
" sering kali memang banyak! Block `impl` bahkan dapat tersebar di beberapa "
"module/berkas."

#: src/methods-and-traits/traits/supertraits.md
msgid ""
"A trait can require that types implementing it also implement other traits, "
"called _supertraits_. Here, any type implementing `Pet` must implement "
"`Animal`."
msgstr ""
"Trait dapat mengharuskan tipe yang mengimplementasikannya juga "
"mengimplementasikan trait lain, yang disebut _supertrait_. Di sini, setiap "
"tipe yang mengimplementasikan `Pet` harus mengimplementasikan `Animal`."

#: src/methods-and-traits/traits/supertraits.md
msgid "\"Rex\""
msgstr "\"Rex\""

#: src/methods-and-traits/traits/supertraits.md
msgid "\"{} has {} legs\""
msgstr "\"{} has {} legs\""

#: src/methods-and-traits/traits/supertraits.md
msgid ""
"This is sometimes called \"trait inheritance\" but students should not "
"expect this to behave like OO inheritance. It just specifies an additional "
"requirement on implementations of a trait."
msgstr ""
"Ini terkadang disebut “trait inheritance”, tetapi peserta sebaiknya tidak "
"menganggap perilakunya sama dengan inheritance dalam OO. Bentuk ini hanya "
"menetapkan persyaratan tambahan bagi implementasi trait."

#: src/methods-and-traits/traits/associated-types.md
msgid ""
"Associated types are placeholder types that are supplied by the trait "
"implementation."
msgstr ""
"Associated type merupakan tipe placeholder yang ditentukan oleh implementasi"
" trait."

