msgstr "`Option` banyak digunakan, bukan hanya dalam standard library."

#: src/std-types/option.md
msgid ""
"`unwrap` will return the value in an `Option`, or panic. `expect` is similar"
" but takes an error message."
msgstr ""
"`unwrap` mengembalikan nilai dalam `Option` atau memicu panic. `expect` "
"serupa, tetapi menerima pesan error."

#: src/std-types/option.md
msgid ""
"You can panic on None, but you can't \"accidentally\" forget to check for "
"None."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat mengalami panic pada None, tetapi tidak dapat “tanpa sengaja” "
"lupa memeriksa None."

#: src/std-types/option.md
msgid ""
"It's common to `unwrap`/`expect` all over the place when hacking something "
"together, but production code typically handles `None` in a nicer fashion."
msgstr ""
"Penggunaan `unwrap`/`expect` di mana-mana umum ketika merangkai kode dengan "
"cepat, tetapi kode production biasanya menangani `None` dengan lebih baik."

#: src/std-types/option.md
msgid ""
"Many of methods on `Option` such as `insert` and `take` can be viewed as "
"treating it like a container with room for at most one element. Methods with"
" similar names and behaviors exist on other container types."
msgstr ""
"Banyak method `Option`, seperti `insert` dan `take`, dapat dipahami sebagai "
"operasi pada container yang memuat paling banyak satu elemen. Method dengan "
"nama dan perilaku serupa juga tersedia pada tipe container lain."

#: src/std-types/option.md
msgid ""
"The \"niche optimization\" means that `Option<T>` typically has the same "
"size in memory as `T`, if there is some representation that is not a valid "
"value of T. For example, a reference cannot be NULL, so `Option<&T>` "
"automatically uses NULL to represent the `None` variant, and thus can be "
"stored in the same memory as `&T`."
msgstr ""
"“Niche optimization” berarti ukuran `Option<T>` dalam memori biasanya sama "
"dengan `T` jika ada representasi yang bukan nilai T yang valid. Misalnya, "
"reference tidak dapat bernilai NULL, sehingga `Option<&T>` otomatis "
"menggunakan NULL untuk variant `None` dan dapat disimpan dalam ruang memori "
"yang sama dengan `&T`."

#: src/std-types/result.md
msgid ""
"`Result` is similar to `Option`, but indicates the success or failure of an "
"operation, each with a different enum variant. It is generic: `Result<T, E>`"
" where `T` is used in the `Ok` variant and `E` appears in the `Err` variant."
msgstr ""
"`Result` serupa dengan `Option`, tetapi menandakan keberhasilan atau "
"kegagalan operasi, masing-masing melalui variant enum yang berbeda. Tipe ini"
" bersifat generic: `Result<T, E>`, dengan `T` pada variant `Ok` dan `E` pada"
" variant `Err`."

