#: src/std-types/result.md
msgid ""
"As with `Option`, the successful value sits inside of `Result`, forcing the "
"developer to explicitly extract it. This encourages error checking. In the "
"case where an error should never happen, `unwrap()` or `expect()` can be "
"called, and this is a signal of the developer intent too."
msgstr ""
"Seperti pada `Option`, nilai hasil keberhasilan berada di dalam `Result`, "
"sehingga developer harus mengambilnya secara eksplisit. Ini mendorong "
"pemeriksaan error. Jika error seharusnya tidak pernah terjadi, `unwrap()` "
"atau `expect()` dapat dipanggil, sekaligus menunjukkan maksud developer."

#: src/std-types/result.md
