msgstr ""
"Sebagai alternatif, HashMap dapat dibuat dari `Iterator` apa pun yang "
"menghasilkan tuple key-value."

#: src/std-types/hashmap.md
msgid ""
"This type has several \"method-specific\" return types, such as "
"`std::collections::hash_map::Keys`. These types often appear in searches of "
"the Rust docs. Show students the docs for this type, and the helpful link "
"back to the `keys` method."
msgstr ""
"Tipe ini memiliki beberapa tipe nilai kembalian khusus method, seperti "
"`std::collections::hash_map::Keys`. Tipe-tipe ini sering muncul dalam "
"pencarian dokumentasi Rust. Tunjukkan dokumentasinya kepada peserta, "
"termasuk tautan yang berguna untuk kembali ke method `keys`."

#: src/std-types/exercise.md
msgid ""
"In this exercise you will take a very simple data structure and make it "
"generic. It uses a [`std::collections::HashMap`](https://doc.rust-"
"lang.org/stable/std/collections/struct.HashMap.html) to keep track of what "
"values have been seen and how many times each one has appeared."
msgstr ""
"Dalam latihan ini, Anda membuat struktur data yang sangat sederhana menjadi "
"generic. Struktur tersebut menggunakan "
"[`std::collections::HashMap`](https://doc.rust-"
"lang.org/stable/std/collections/struct.HashMap.html) untuk mencatat nilai "
"yang pernah ditemui dan jumlah kemunculan setiap nilai."

#: src/std-types/exercise.md
msgid ""
"The initial version of `Counter` is hardcoded to only work for `char` "
"values. Make the struct and its methods generic over the type of value being"
" tracked, that way `Counter` can track any type of value."
msgstr ""
"Versi awal `Counter` ditulis khusus untuk nilai `char`. Jadikan struct dan "
"method-nya generic terhadap tipe nilai yang dicatat agar `Counter` dapat "
"mencatat nilai bertipe apa pun."

#: src/std-types/exercise.md
msgid ""
"If you finish early, try using the [`entry`](https://doc.rust-"
"lang.org/stable/std/collections/struct.HashMap.html#method.entry) method to "
"halve the number of hash lookups required to implement the `count` method."
msgstr ""
"Jika selesai lebih awal, coba gunakan method [`entry`](https://doc.rust-"
"lang.org/stable/std/collections/struct.HashMap.html#method.entry) untuk "
"mengurangi separuh jumlah hash lookup yang diperlukan dalam implementasi "
"method `count`."

