".- - - - - - - - - - - - - -.     .- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -.\n"
":                           :     :                                     :\n"
":    s1 \"(inaccessible)\"    :     :                                     :\n"
":   +-----------+-------+   :     :   +----+----+----+----+----+----+   :\n"
":   | ptr       |   o---+---+--+--+-->| H  | e  | l  | l  | o  | !  |   :\n"
":   | len       |     6 |   :  |  :   +----+----+----+----+----+----+   :\n"
":   | capacity  |     6 |   :  |  :                                     :\n"
":   +-----------+-------+   :  |  :                                     :\n"
":                           :  |  `- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -'\n"
":    s2                     :  |\n"
":   +-----------+-------+   :  |\n"
":   | ptr       |   o---+---+--'\n"
":   | len       |     6 |   :\n"
":   | capacity  |     6 |   :\n"
