#: src/borrowing/exercise.md
msgid ""
"The goal of this exercise is to practice the core concepts of ownership and "
"borrowing, specifically the rule that you cannot mutate a collection while "
"holding a reference to one of its elements."
msgstr ""
"Latihan ini bertujuan melatih konsep inti ownership dan borrowing, khususnya"
" aturan bahwa collection tidak dapat diubah selama reference ke salah satu "
"elemennya masih dipegang."

#: src/borrowing/exercise.md
msgid ""
"`add_spell` should take ownership of a `Spell` and move it into the "
"`Wizard`'s inventory."
msgstr ""
"`add_spell` sebaiknya mengambil ownership atas `Spell` dan memindahkannya ke"
" inventaris `Wizard`."

#: src/borrowing/exercise.md
msgid "`cast_spell` is the core of the exercise. It needs to:"
msgstr "`cast_spell` merupakan inti latihan ini. Fungsi tersebut perlu:"

#: src/borrowing/exercise.md
msgid "Find the spell (by index or by reference)."
msgstr "Menemukan mantra melalui indeks atau reference."

#: src/borrowing/exercise.md
msgid "Check mana and decrement it."
msgstr "Memeriksa mana dan menguranginya."

#: src/borrowing/exercise.md
msgid "Decrement the spell's `uses`."
msgstr "Mengurangi `uses` mantra."

#: src/borrowing/exercise.md
msgid "Remove the spell if `uses == 0`."
msgstr "Menghapus mantra jika `uses == 0`."

#: src/borrowing/exercise.md
msgid ""
"**Borrow Checker Conflict:** If students try to hold a reference to the "
"spell (e.g., `let spell = &mut self.spells[i]`) and then call "
"`self.spells.remove(i)` while that reference is still \"alive\" in the same "
"scope, the borrow checker will complain. This is a great opportunity to show"
" how to structure code to satisfy the borrow checker (e.g., by using indices"
" or by ensuring the borrow ends before the mutation)."
msgstr ""
"**Konflik Borrow Checker:** Jika peserta memegang reference ke mantra, "
"misalnya `let spell = &mut self.spells[i]`, lalu memanggil "
"`self.spells.remove(i)` ketika reference itu masih “hidup” dalam scope yang "
"sama, borrow checker akan memberikan error. Ini kesempatan yang baik untuk "
"menunjukkan penataan kode yang memenuhi aturan borrow checker, misalnya "
"melalui indeks atau dengan memastikan borrow berakhir sebelum perubahan "
"dilakukan."

#: src/borrowing/solution.md
msgid "Solution: Wizard's Inventory"
msgstr "Solusi: Inventaris Penyihir"

