#: src/welcome-day-4.md
msgid "Welcome to Day 4"
msgstr "Selamat Datang di Hari 4"

#: src/welcome-day-4.md
msgid "We have mastered the core language and its unique safety model:"
msgstr "Kita telah menguasai inti bahasa dan model keamanannya yang khas:"

#: src/welcome-day-4.md
msgid ""
"**Foundations & Abstraction:** Traits, generics, and the standard library."
msgstr "**Dasar dan Abstraksi:** Trait, generics, dan standard library."

#: src/welcome-day-4.md
msgid "**Ownership:** Move semantics and the `Drop` trait."
msgstr "**Ownership:** Move semantics dan trait `Drop`."

#: src/welcome-day-4.md
msgid "**Memory Management:** Borrowing rules (`&` vs `&mut`) and lifetimes."
msgstr ""
"**Pengelolaan Memori:** Aturan borrowing (`&` dibandingkan `&mut`) dan "
"lifetime."

#: src/welcome-day-4.md
msgid ""
"**Smart Pointers:** `Box`, `Rc`, and `RefCell` for complex data structures."
msgstr ""
"**Smart Pointer:** `Box`, `Rc`, dan `RefCell` untuk struktur data kompleks."

#: src/welcome-day-4.md
msgid ""
"You now understand how Rust guarantees memory safety at compile time! Today "
"we focus on applying this knowledge to build robust, large-scale "
"applications."
msgstr ""
"Sekarang Anda memahami bagaimana Rust menjamin memory safety saat compile "
"time! Hari ini kita berfokus menerapkan pengetahuan tersebut untuk membangun"
" aplikasi berskala besar yang andal."

