#: src/iterators/for.md
msgid ""
"Previously when we looked at `for` loops, we saw that they can accept "
"anything that represents a sequence of values. Under the hood Rust uses a "
"concept called **iterators** to provide a unified way to walk through a "
"sequence like this."
msgstr ""
"Saat membahas loop `for`, kita melihat bahwa loop ini menerima apa pun yang "
"merepresentasikan rangkaian nilai. Di balik layar, Rust menggunakan konsep "
"**iterator** untuk menyediakan cara yang seragam dalam menelusuri rangkaian "
"tersebut."

#: src/iterators/for.md
msgid "// Accepts a range.\n"
msgstr "// Accepts a range.\n"

#: src/iterators/for.md
