#: src/testing/lints.md
msgid ""
"The Rust compiler produces fantastic error messages, as well as helpful "
"built-in lints. [Clippy](https://doc.rust-lang.org/clippy/) provides even "
"more lints, organized into groups that can be enabled per-project."
msgstr ""
"Compiler Rust menghasilkan pesan error yang sangat baik dan lint bawaan yang"
" membantu. [Clippy](https://doc.rust-lang.org/clippy/) menyediakan lebih "
"banyak lint, yang dikelompokkan dan dapat diaktifkan per proyek."

#: src/testing/lints.md
msgid "\"X probably fits in a u16, right? {}\""
msgstr "\"X probably fits in a u16, right? {}\""

#: src/testing/lints.md
msgid ""
"There are compiler lints visible here, but not clippy lints. Run `clippy` on"
" the playground site to show clippy warnings. Clippy has extensive "
"documentation of its lints, and adds new lints (including default-deny "
"lints) all the time."
msgstr ""
"Contoh ini menampilkan lint compiler, tetapi belum lint clippy. Jalankan "
"`clippy` di situs playground untuk menunjukkan warning clippy. Dokumentasi "
"lint Clippy lengkap, dan lint baru, termasuk lint default-deny, terus "
"ditambahkan."

#: src/testing/lints.md
msgid ""
"Note that errors or warnings with `help: ...` can be fixed with `cargo fix` "
"or via your editor."
msgstr ""
"Perhatikan bahwa error atau warning dengan `help: ...` dapat diperbaiki "
"menggunakan `cargo fix` atau melalui editor."

#: src/testing/exercise.md
msgid ""
"The [Luhn algorithm](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luhn_algorithm) is used "
"to validate credit card numbers. The algorithm takes a string as input and "
"does the following to validate the credit card number:"
msgstr ""
"[Algoritma Luhn](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luhn_algorithm) digunakan "
"untuk memvalidasi nomor kartu kredit. Algoritma menerima input string dan "
"melakukan langkah berikut untuk memvalidasi nomornya:"

#: src/testing/exercise.md
msgid ""
"Ignore all spaces. Reject numbers with fewer than two digits. Reject letters"
" and other non-digit characters."
msgstr ""
"Abaikan semua spasi. Tolak nomor yang memiliki kurang dari dua digit. Tolak "
"huruf dan karakter bukan digit lainnya."

#: src/testing/exercise.md
msgid ""
"Moving from **right to left**, double every second digit: for the number "
"`1234`, we double `3` and `1`. For the number `98765`, we double `6` and "
"`8`."
msgstr ""
"Dari **kanan ke kiri**, gandakan setiap digit kedua: untuk `1234`, gandakan "
"`3` dan `1`. Untuk `98765`, gandakan `6` dan `8`."

#: src/testing/exercise.md
msgid ""
"After doubling a digit, sum the digits if the result is greater than 9. So "
"doubling `7` becomes `14` which becomes `1 + 4 = 5`."
msgstr ""
"Setelah digit digandakan, jumlahkan digit hasilnya jika lebih besar dari 9. "
"Jadi, `7` menjadi `14`, lalu menjadi `1 + 4 = 5`."

#: src/testing/exercise.md
msgid "Sum all the undoubled and doubled digits."
msgstr "Jumlahkan semua digit yang tidak digandakan dan hasil penggandaan."

#: src/testing/exercise.md
msgid "The credit card number is valid if the sum ends with `0`."
msgstr "Nomor kartu kredit valid jika hasil penjumlahan diakhiri `0`."

#: src/testing/exercise.md
msgid ""
"The provided code provides a buggy implementation of the Luhn algorithm, "
"along with two basic unit tests that confirm that most of the algorithm is "
"implemented correctly."
msgstr ""
"Kode yang disediakan berisi implementasi algoritma Luhn yang memiliki bug, "
"beserta dua unit test dasar yang memastikan sebagian besar algoritma "
"diimplementasikan dengan benar."

