msgid "This invocation should expand to:"
msgstr "Pemanggilan ini seharusnya diperluas menjadi:"

#: src/macros/macro_rules/pattern-matching/exercise.md
#: src/macros/macro_rules/fragment-specifiers/exercise.md
#: src/macros/macro_rules/repetition/exercise.md
#: src/macros/macro_rules/techniques/accumulators/exercise.md
msgid "Instructions:"
msgstr "Instruksi:"

#: src/macros/macro_rules/pattern-matching/exercise.md
msgid "Implement the `define_op!` macro."
msgstr "Implementasikan macro `define_op!`."

#: src/macros/macro_rules/pattern-matching/exercise.md
msgid ""
"Capture the function name as an `ident` and the arithmetic operator as a "
"`tt` (Token Tree)."
msgstr ""
"Tangkap nama fungsi sebagai `ident` dan operator aritmetika sebagai `tt` "
"(Token Tree)."

