#: src/android.md
msgid "Welcome to Rust in Android"
msgstr "Selamat Datang di Rust di Android"

#: src/android.md
msgid ""
"Rust is supported for system software on Android. This means that you can "
"write new services, libraries, drivers or even firmware in Rust (or improve "
"existing code as needed)."
msgstr ""
"Rust didukung untuk perangkat lunak sistem di Android. Ini berarti Anda "
"dapat menulis layanan, library, driver, atau bahkan firmware baru dalam Rust"
" (atau meningkatkan kode yang sudah ada sesuai kebutuhan)."

#: src/android.md
msgid ""
"The speaker may mention any of the following given the increased use of Rust"
" in Android:"
msgstr ""
"Pembicara dapat menyebutkan salah satu dari hal berikut mengingat "
"meningkatnya penggunaan Rust di Android:"

#: src/android.md
msgid ""
"Service example: [DNS over "
"HTTP](https://security.googleblog.com/2022/07/dns-over-http3-in-"
"android.html)."
msgstr ""
"Contoh layanan: [DNS over HTTP](https://security.googleblog.com/2022/07/dns-"
"over-http3-in-android.html)."

#: src/android.md
msgid ""
"Libraries: [Rutabaga Virtual Graphics "
"Interface](https://crosvm.dev/book/appendix/rutabaga_gfx.html)."
msgstr ""
"Library: [Rutabaga Virtual Graphics "
"Interface](https://crosvm.dev/book/appendix/rutabaga_gfx.html)."

#: src/android.md
msgid ""
"Kernel Drivers: [Binder](https://lore.kernel.org/rust-for-"
"linux/20231101-rust-binder-v1-0-08ba9197f637@google.com/)."
msgstr ""
"Driver Kernel: [Binder](https://lore.kernel.org/rust-for-"
"linux/20231101-rust-binder-v1-0-08ba9197f637@google.com/)."

#: src/android.md
msgid ""
"Firmware: [pKVM firmware](https://security.googleblog.com/2023/10/bare-"
"metal-rust-in-android.html)."
msgstr ""
"Firmware: [Firmware pKVM](https://security.googleblog.com/2023/10/bare-"
"metal-rust-in-android.html)."

#: src/android/setup.md
msgid ""
"We will be using a Cuttlefish Android Virtual Device to test our code. Make "
"sure you have access to one or create a new one with:"
msgstr ""
"Kami akan menggunakan Android Virtual Device Cuttlefish untuk menguji kode "
"kita. Pastikan Anda memiliki akses ke salah satunya atau buat yang baru "
"dengan:"

#: src/android/setup.md
msgid ""
"Please see the [Android Developer "
"Codelab](https://source.android.com/docs/setup/start) for details."
msgstr ""
"Lihat [Codelab Developer "
"Android](https://source.android.com/docs/setup/start) untuk detailnya."

#: src/android/setup.md
msgid ""
"The code on the following pages can be found in the [`src/android/` "
"directory](https://github.com/google/comprehensive-"
"rust/tree/main/src/android) of the course material. Please `git clone` the "
"repository to follow along."
msgstr ""
"Kode pada halaman berikut dapat ditemukan di [direktori "
"`src/android/`](https://github.com/google/comprehensive-"
"rust/tree/main/src/android) materi kursus. Silakan `git clone` repositori "
"tersebut untuk mengikuti."

#: src/android/setup.md
msgid ""
"Cuttlefish is a reference Android device designed to work on generic Linux "
"desktops. MacOS support is also planned."
msgstr ""
"Cuttlefish adalah perangkat Android referensi yang dirancang untuk bekerja "
"pada desktop Linux generik. Dukungan MacOS juga direncanakan."

#: src/android/setup.md
msgid ""
"The Cuttlefish system image maintains high fidelity to real devices, and is "
"the ideal emulator to run many Rust use cases."
msgstr ""
"Image sistem Cuttlefish menjaga fidelity yang tinggi terhadap perangkat "
"nyata, dan merupakan emulator ideal untuk menjalankan banyak kasus "
"penggunaan Rust."

#: src/android/build-rules.md
msgid ""
"The Android build system (Soong) supports Rust through several modules:"
msgstr "Sistem build Android (Soong) mendukung Rust melalui beberapa modul:"

#: src/android/build-rules.md
msgid "Module Type"
msgstr "Jenis Modul"

#: src/android/build-rules.md
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Deskripsi"

#: src/android/build-rules.md
msgid "`rust_binary`"
msgstr "`rust_binary`"

#: src/android/build-rules.md
msgid "Produces a Rust binary."
msgstr "Menghasilkan binary Rust."

#: src/android/build-rules.md
msgid "`rust_library`"
msgstr "`rust_library`"

#: src/android/build-rules.md
msgid ""
"Produces a Rust library, and provides both `rlib` and `dylib` variants."
msgstr ""
"Menghasilkan library Rust, dan menyediakan varian `rlib` maupun `dylib`."

#: src/android/build-rules.md
msgid "`rust_ffi`"
msgstr "`rust_ffi`"

#: src/android/build-rules.md
msgid ""
"Produces a Rust C library usable by `cc` modules, and provides both static "
"and shared variants."
msgstr ""
"Menghasilkan library C Rust yang dapat digunakan oleh modul `cc`, dan "
"menyediakan varian statis maupun shared."

#: src/android/build-rules.md
msgid "`rust_proc_macro`"
msgstr "`rust_proc_macro`"

#: src/android/build-rules.md
msgid ""
"Produces a `proc-macro` Rust library. These are analogous to compiler "
"plugins."
msgstr ""
"Menghasilkan library Rust `proc-macro`. Ini serupa dengan plugin compiler."

#: src/android/build-rules.md
msgid "`rust_test`"
msgstr "`rust_test`"

#: src/android/build-rules.md
msgid "Produces a Rust test binary that uses the standard Rust test harness."
msgstr ""
"Menghasilkan binary test Rust yang menggunakan test harness Rust standar."

#: src/android/build-rules.md
msgid "`rust_fuzz`"
msgstr "`rust_fuzz`"

#: src/android/build-rules.md
msgid "Produces a Rust fuzz binary leveraging `libfuzzer`."
msgstr "Menghasilkan binary fuzz Rust yang memanfaatkan `libfuzzer`."

#: src/android/build-rules.md
msgid "`rust_protobuf`"
msgstr "`rust_protobuf`"

#: src/android/build-rules.md
msgid ""
"Generates source and produces a Rust library that provides an interface for "
"a particular protobuf."
msgstr ""
"Menghasilkan kode sumber dan library Rust yang menyediakan antarmuka untuk "
"protobuf tertentu."

#: src/android/build-rules.md
msgid "`rust_bindgen`"
msgstr "`rust_bindgen`"

#: src/android/build-rules.md
msgid ""
"Generates source and produces a Rust library containing Rust bindings to C "
"libraries."
msgstr ""
"Menghasilkan kode sumber dan library Rust yang berisi binding Rust ke "
"library C."

#: src/android/build-rules.md
msgid "We will look at `rust_binary` and `rust_library` next."
msgstr "Kami akan melihat `rust_binary` dan `rust_library` selanjutnya."

#: src/android/build-rules.md
msgid "Additional items the speaker may mention:"
msgstr "Hal tambahan yang mungkin disebutkan pembicara:"

#: src/android/build-rules.md
msgid ""
"Cargo is not optimized for multi-language repositories, and also downloads "
"packages from the internet."
msgstr ""
"Cargo tidak dioptimalkan untuk repositori multi-bahasa, dan juga mengunduh "
"paket dari internet."

#: src/android/build-rules.md
msgid ""
"For compliance and performance, Android must have crates in-tree. It must "
"also interoperate with C/C++/Java code. Soong fills that gap."
msgstr ""
"Untuk kepatuhan dan performa, Android harus memiliki crate di dalam tree. "
"Android juga harus berinteroperasi dengan kode C/C++/Java. Soong mengisi "
"celah tersebut."

#: src/android/build-rules.md
msgid ""
"Soong has many similarities to [Bazel](https://bazel.build/), which is the "
"open-source variant of Blaze (used in google3)."
msgstr ""
"Soong memiliki banyak kesamaan dengan [Bazel](https://bazel.build/), yaitu "
"varian open-source dari Blaze (yang digunakan di google3)."

#: src/android/build-rules.md
msgid "Fun fact: Data from Star Trek is a Soong-type Android."
msgstr "Fakta menarik: Data dari Star Trek adalah Android tipe Soong."

