msgid ""
"Point out the path to the generated `IBirthdayService` trait, and explain "
"why each of the segments is necessary."
msgstr ""
"Tunjukkan path ke trait `IBirthdayService` yang dihasilkan, dan jelaskan "
"mengapa setiap segmennya diperlukan."

#: src/android/aidl/example-service/service.md
msgid ""
"Note that `wishHappyBirthday` and other AIDL IPC methods take `&self` "
"(instead of `&mut self`)."
msgstr ""
"Perhatikan bahwa `wishHappyBirthday` dan method IPC AIDL lainnya menerima "
"`&self` (bukan `&mut self`)."

#: src/android/aidl/example-service/service.md
msgid ""
"This is necessary because Binder responds to incoming requests on a thread "
"pool, allowing for multiple requests to be processed in parallel. This "
"requires that the service methods only get a shared reference to `self`."
msgstr ""
"Ini diperlukan karena Binder merespons permintaan yang masuk pada thread "
"pool, sehingga memungkinkan beberapa permintaan diproses secara paralel. Ini"
" mengharuskan method layanan hanya menerima shared reference ke `self`."

#: src/android/aidl/example-service/service.md
msgid ""
"Any state that needs to be modified by the service will have to be put in "
"something like a `Mutex` to allow for safe mutation."
msgstr ""
"State apa pun yang perlu diubah oleh layanan harus ditempatkan dalam sesuatu"
" seperti `Mutex` agar mutasi aman."

#: src/android/aidl/example-service/service.md
msgid ""
"The correct approach for managing service state depends heavily on the "
"details of your service."
msgstr ""
"Pendekatan yang tepat untuk mengelola state layanan sangat bergantung pada "
"detail layanan Anda."

