#: src/android/aidl/example-service/server.md
msgid ""
"The process for taking a user-defined service implementation (in this case, "
"the `BirthdayService` type, which implements the `IBirthdayService`) and "
"starting it as a Binder service has multiple steps. This may appear more "
"complicated than students are used to if they've used Binder from C++ or "
"another language. Explain to students why each step is necessary."
msgstr ""
"Proses untuk mengambil implementasi layanan yang ditentukan pengguna (dalam "
"hal ini, tipe `BirthdayService`, yang mengimplementasikan "
"`IBirthdayService`) dan menjalankannya sebagai layanan Binder memiliki "
"beberapa langkah. Ini mungkin tampak lebih rumit daripada yang biasa dialami"
" siswa jika mereka pernah menggunakan Binder dari C++ atau bahasa lain. "
"Jelaskan kepada siswa mengapa setiap langkah diperlukan."

#: src/android/aidl/example-service/server.md
msgid "Create an instance of your service type (`BirthdayService`)."
msgstr "Buat instance tipe layanan Anda (`BirthdayService`)."

#: src/android/aidl/example-service/server.md
msgid ""
"Wrap the service object in the corresponding `Bn*` type (`BnBirthdayService`"
" in this case). This type is generated by Binder and provides common Binder "
"functionality, similar to the `BnBinder` base class in C++. Since Rust "
"doesn't have inheritance, we use composition, putting our `BirthdayService` "
"within the generated `BnBinderService`."
msgstr ""
"Bungkus objek layanan dalam tipe `Bn*` yang sesuai (`BnBirthdayService` "
"dalam kasus ini). Tipe ini dihasilkan oleh Binder dan menyediakan "
"fungsionalitas Binder umum, serupa dengan class dasar `BnBinder` di C++. "
"Karena Rust tidak memiliki inheritance, kami menggunakan komposisi, "
"menempatkan `BirthdayService` kami di dalam `BnBinderService` yang "
"dihasilkan."

#: src/android/aidl/example-service/server.md
msgid ""
"Call `add_service`, giving it a service identifier and your service object "
"(the `BnBirthdayService` object in the example)."
msgstr ""
"Panggil `add_service`, dengan memberikan identifier layanan dan objek "
"layanan Anda (objek `BnBirthdayService` pada contoh)."

#: src/android/aidl/example-service/server.md
msgid ""
"Call `join_thread_pool` to add the current thread to Binder's thread pool "
"and start listening for connections."
msgstr ""
"Panggil `join_thread_pool` untuk menambahkan thread saat ini ke thread pool "
"Binder dan mulai mendengarkan koneksi."

#: src/android/aidl/example-service/deploy.md
msgid "We can now build, push, and start the service:"
msgstr "Kami sekarang dapat melakukan build, push, dan menjalankan layanan:"

#: src/android/aidl/example-service/deploy.md
msgid ""
"```shell\n"
"m birthday_server\n"
"adb push \"$ANDROID_PRODUCT_OUT/system/bin/birthday_server\" /data/local/tmp\n"
"adb root\n"
"adb shell /data/local/tmp/birthday_server\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```shell\n"
"m birthday_server\n"
"adb push \"$ANDROID_PRODUCT_OUT/system/bin/birthday_server\" /data/local/tmp\n"
"adb root\n"
"adb shell /data/local/tmp/birthday_server\n"
"```"

