msgstr "\"org$blobstore$cxxbridge1$BlobstoreClient$put\""

#: src/android/interoperability/cpp/cpp-bridge.md
msgid ""
"The programmer does not need to promise that the signatures they have typed "
"in are accurate. CXX performs static assertions that the signatures exactly "
"correspond with what is declared in C++."
msgstr ""
"Programmer tidak perlu menjamin bahwa signature yang mereka ketik akurat. "
"CXX melakukan assertion statis bahwa signature tersebut benar-benar sesuai "
"dengan yang dideklarasikan di C++."

#: src/android/interoperability/cpp/cpp-bridge.md
msgid ""
"`unsafe extern` blocks allow you to declare C++ functions that are safe to "
"call from Rust."
msgstr ""
"Block `unsafe extern` memungkinkan Anda mendeklarasikan fungsi C++ yang aman"
" dipanggil dari Rust."

