"These types can be used in the fields of shared structs and the arguments "
"and returns of extern functions."
msgstr ""
"Tipe-tipe ini dapat digunakan pada field struct bersama serta pada argumen "
"dan nilai kembalian fungsi extern."

#: src/android/interoperability/cpp/type-mapping.md
msgid ""
"Note that Rust's `String` does not map directly to `std::string`. There are "
"a few reasons for this:"
msgstr ""
"Perhatikan bahwa `String` milik Rust tidak dipetakan langsung ke "
"`std::string`. Ada beberapa alasan untuk ini:"

#: src/android/interoperability/cpp/type-mapping.md
msgid ""
"`std::string` does not uphold the UTF-8 invariant that `String` requires."
msgstr ""
"`std::string` tidak mempertahankan invariant UTF-8 yang diwajibkan `String`."

#: src/android/interoperability/cpp/type-mapping.md
msgid ""
"The two types have different layouts in memory and so can't be passed "
"directly between languages."
msgstr ""
"Kedua tipe memiliki layout memori yang berbeda sehingga tidak dapat "
"diteruskan langsung antarbahasa."

#: src/android/interoperability/cpp/type-mapping.md
msgid ""
"`std::string` requires move constructors that don't match Rust's move "
"semantics, so a `std::string` can't be passed by value to Rust."
msgstr ""
"`std::string` memerlukan move constructor yang tidak sesuai dengan semantik "
"move Rust, sehingga `std::string` tidak dapat diteruskan by value ke Rust."

