msgid ""
"Depending on the crate source code layout, you may also need to use this "
"file to specify where its `LICENSE` file(s) can be found."
msgstr ""
"Bergantung pada layout kode sumber crate, Anda mungkin juga perlu "
"menggunakan berkas ini untuk menentukan di mana berkas `LICENSE`-nya dapat "
"ditemukan."

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/configuring-gnrt-config-toml.md
msgid ""
"Later, we'll see some other things you will need to configure in this file "
"to resolve problems."
msgstr ""
"Nanti, kami akan melihat beberapa hal lain yang perlu Anda konfigurasi dalam"
" berkas ini untuk menyelesaikan masalah."

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/downloading-crates.md
msgid ""
"A tool called `gnrt` knows how to download crates and how to generate "
"`BUILD.gn` rules."
msgstr ""
"Alat bernama `gnrt` mengetahui cara mengunduh crate dan cara menghasilkan "
"aturan `BUILD.gn`."

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/downloading-crates.md
msgid "To start, download the crate you want like this:"
msgstr "Untuk memulai, unduh crate yang Anda inginkan seperti ini:"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/downloading-crates.md
msgid ""
"Although the `gnrt` tool is part of the Chromium source code, by running "
"this command you will be downloading and running its dependencies from "
"`crates.io`. See [the earlier section](../cargo.md) discussing this security"
" decision."
msgstr ""
"Meskipun alat `gnrt` adalah bagian dari kode sumber Chromium, dengan "
"menjalankan perintah ini Anda akan mengunduh dan menjalankan dependensinya "
"dari `crates.io`. Lihat [bagian sebelumnya](../cargo.md) yang membahas "
"keputusan keamanan ini."

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/downloading-crates.md
msgid "This `vendor` command may download:"
msgstr "Perintah `vendor` ini mungkin mengunduh:"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/downloading-crates.md
msgid "Your crate"
msgstr "Crate Anda"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/downloading-crates.md
msgid "Direct and transitive dependencies"
msgstr "Dependensi langsung dan transitif"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/downloading-crates.md
msgid ""
"New versions of other crates, as required by `cargo` to resolve the complete"
" set of crates required by Chromium."
msgstr ""
"Versi baru crate lain, sesuai kebutuhan `cargo` untuk menyelesaikan seluruh "
"rangkaian crate yang dibutuhkan Chromium."

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/downloading-crates.md
msgid ""
"Chromium maintains patches for some crates, kept in "
"`//third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io/patches`. These will be reapplied "
"automatically, but if patching fails you may need to take manual action."
msgstr ""
"Chromium memelihara patch untuk beberapa crate, disimpan di "
"`//third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io/patches`. Patch ini akan diterapkan "
"ulang secara otomatis, tetapi jika patch gagal Anda mungkin perlu melakukan "
"tindakan manual."

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/generating-gn-build-rules.md
msgid ""
"Once you've downloaded the crate, generate the `BUILD.gn` files like this:"
msgstr "Setelah mengunduh crate, hasilkan berkas `BUILD.gn` seperti ini:"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/generating-gn-build-rules.md
msgid "Now run `git status`. You should find:"
msgstr "Sekarang jalankan `git status`. Anda seharusnya menemukan:"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/generating-gn-build-rules.md
msgid ""
"At least one new crate source code in "
"`third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io/vendor`"
msgstr ""
"Setidaknya satu kode sumber crate baru di "
"`third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io/vendor`"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/generating-gn-build-rules.md
msgid ""
"At least one new `BUILD.gn` in `third_party/rust/<crate name>/v<major semver"
" version>`"
msgstr ""
"Setidaknya satu `BUILD.gn` baru di `third_party/rust/<crate name>/v<major "
"semver version>`"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/generating-gn-build-rules.md
msgid "An appropriate `README.chromium`"
msgstr "`README.chromium` yang sesuai"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/generating-gn-build-rules.md
msgid ""
"The \"major semver version\" is a [Rust \"semver\" version "
"number](https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/reference/semver.html)."
msgstr ""
"\"Versi semver mayor\" adalah [nomor versi \"semver\" "
"Rust](https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/reference/semver.html)."

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/generating-gn-build-rules.md
msgid ""
"Take a close look, especially at the things generated in `third_party/rust`."
msgstr ""
"Perhatikan dengan saksama, terutama hal-hal yang dihasilkan di "
"`third_party/rust`."

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/generating-gn-build-rules.md
msgid ""
"Talk a little about semver --- and specifically the way that in Chromium "
"it's to allow multiple incompatible versions of a crate, which is "
"discouraged but sometimes necessary in the Cargo ecosystem."
msgstr ""
"Bahas sedikit tentang semver --- dan secara khusus cara di Chromium yang "
"memungkinkan beberapa versi crate yang tidak kompatibel, yang tidak "
"dianjurkan tetapi kadang diperlukan dalam ekosistem Cargo."

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/resolving-problems.md
msgid ""
"If your build fails, it may be because of a `build.rs`: programs which do "
"arbitrary things at build time. This is fundamentally at odds with the "
"design of `gn` and `ninja` which aim for static, deterministic, build rules "
"to maximize parallelism and repeatability of builds."
msgstr ""
"Jika build Anda gagal, penyebabnya mungkin `build.rs`: program yang "
"melakukan hal arbitrer pada waktu build. Ini secara fundamental bertentangan"
" dengan desain `gn` dan `ninja` yang mengutamakan aturan build statis dan "
"deterministik untuk memaksimalkan paralelisme dan keterulangan build."

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/resolving-problems.md
msgid ""
"Some `build.rs` actions are automatically supported; others require action:"
msgstr ""
"Beberapa tindakan `build.rs` didukung secara otomatis; yang lain memerlukan "
"tindakan:"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/resolving-problems.md
msgid "build script effect"
msgstr "efek build script"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/resolving-problems.md
msgid "Supported by our gn templates"
msgstr "Didukung oleh template gn kami"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/resolving-problems.md
msgid "Work required by you"
msgstr "Pekerjaan yang Anda perlukan"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/resolving-problems.md
msgid "Checking rustc version to configure features on and off"
msgstr "Memeriksa versi rustc untuk mengaktifkan dan menonaktifkan fitur"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/resolving-problems.md
#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/introduction/responsibility-shift.md
#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/memory-lifecycle.md
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Ya"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/resolving-problems.md
msgid "None"
msgstr "Tidak ada"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/resolving-problems.md
msgid "Checking platform or CPU to configure features on and off"
msgstr ""
"Memeriksa platform atau CPU untuk mengaktifkan dan menonaktifkan fitur"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/resolving-problems.md
msgid "Generating code"
msgstr "Menghasilkan kode"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/resolving-problems.md
msgid "Yes - specify in `gnrt_config.toml`"
msgstr "Ya - tentukan di `gnrt_config.toml`"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/resolving-problems.md
msgid "Building C/C++"
msgstr "Membangun C/C++"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/resolving-problems.md
#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/memory-lifecycle.md
msgid "No"
msgstr "Tidak"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/resolving-problems.md
msgid "Patch around it"
msgstr "Buat patch untuk mengatasinya"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/resolving-problems.md
msgid "Arbitrary other actions"
msgstr "Tindakan arbitrer lainnya"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/resolving-problems.md
msgid ""
"Fortunately, most crates don't contain a build script, and fortunately, most"
" build scripts only do the top two actions."
msgstr ""
"Untungnya, sebagian besar crate tidak berisi build script, dan untungnya, "
"sebagian besar build script hanya melakukan dua tindakan teratas."

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/resolving-problems/build-scripts-which-generate-code.md
msgid ""
"If `ninja` complains about missing files, check the `build.rs` to see if it "
"writes source code files."
msgstr ""
"Jika `ninja` mengeluh tentang berkas yang hilang, periksa `build.rs` untuk "
"melihat apakah build script tersebut menulis berkas kode sumber."

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/resolving-problems/build-scripts-which-generate-code.md
msgid ""
"If so, modify [`gnrt_config.toml`](../configuring-gnrt-config-toml.md) to "
"add `build-script-outputs` to the crate. If this is a transitive dependency,"
" that is, one on which Chromium code should not directly depend, also add "
"`allow-first-party-usage=false`. There are several examples already in that "
"file:"
msgstr ""
"Jika demikian, ubah [`gnrt_config.toml`](../configuring-gnrt-config-toml.md)"
" untuk menambahkan `build-script-outputs` ke crate tersebut. Jika ini "
"dependensi transitif, yaitu dependensi yang tidak boleh dijadikan dependensi"
" langsung oleh kode Chromium, tambahkan juga `allow-first-party-"
"usage=false`. Sudah ada beberapa contoh di berkas tersebut:"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/resolving-problems/build-scripts-which-generate-code.md
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"[crate.unicode-linebreak]\n"
"allow-first-party-usage = false\n"
"build-script-outputs = [\"tables.rs\"]\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```toml\n"
"[crate.unicode-linebreak]\n"
"allow-first-party-usage = false\n"
"build-script-outputs = [\"tables.rs\"]\n"
"```"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/resolving-problems/build-scripts-which-generate-code.md
msgid ""
"Now rerun [`gnrt.py -- gen`](../generating-gn-build-rules.md) to regenerate "
"`BUILD.gn` files to inform ninja that this particular output file is input "
"to subsequent build steps."
msgstr ""
"Sekarang jalankan ulang [`gnrt.py -- gen`](../generating-gn-build-rules.md) "
"untuk menghasilkan ulang berkas `BUILD.gn` agar ninja mengetahui bahwa "
"berkas output tertentu ini merupakan input bagi langkah build berikutnya."

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/resolving-problems/build-scripts-which-take-arbitrary-actions.md
msgid ""
"Some crates use the [`cc`](https://crates.io/crates/cc) crate to build and "
"link C/C++ libraries. Other crates parse C/C++ using "
"[`bindgen`](https://crates.io/crates/bindgen) within their build scripts. "
"These actions can't be supported in a Chromium context --- our gn, ninja and"
" LLVM build system is very specific in expressing relationships between "
"build actions."
msgstr ""
"Sebagian crate menggunakan crate [`cc`](https://crates.io/crates/cc) untuk "
"membangun dan menautkan library C/C++. Crate lain mengurai C/C++ menggunakan"
" [`bindgen`](https://crates.io/crates/bindgen) di dalam build script-nya. "
"Tindakan ini tidak dapat didukung dalam konteks Chromium --- sistem build "
"gn, ninja, dan LLVM kami sangat spesifik dalam mengekspresikan hubungan "
"antarlangkah build."

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/resolving-problems/build-scripts-which-take-arbitrary-actions.md
msgid "So, your options are:"
msgstr "Jadi, pilihan Anda adalah:"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/resolving-problems/build-scripts-which-take-arbitrary-actions.md
msgid "Avoid these crates"
msgstr "Hindari crate tersebut"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/resolving-problems/build-scripts-which-take-arbitrary-actions.md
msgid "Apply a patch to the crate."
msgstr "Terapkan patch pada crate."

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/resolving-problems/build-scripts-which-take-arbitrary-actions.md
msgid ""
"Patches should be kept in "
"`third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io/patches/<crate>` - see for example the "
"[patches against the `cxx` "
"crate](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io/patches/cxx/)"
" - and will be applied automatically by `gnrt` each time it upgrades the "
"crate."
msgstr ""
"Patch sebaiknya disimpan di "
"`third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io/patches/<crate>` - lihat misalnya "
"[patch untuk crate "
"`cxx`](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io/patches/cxx/)"
" - dan akan diterapkan secara otomatis oleh `gnrt` setiap kali melakukan "
"upgrade crate."

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/depending-on-a-crate.md
msgid ""
"Once you've added a third-party crate and generated build rules, depending "
"on a crate is simple. Find your `rust_static_library` target, and add a "
"`dep` on the `:lib` target within your crate."
msgstr ""
"Setelah menambahkan crate pihak ketiga dan menghasilkan aturan build, "
"menjadikan crate sebagai dependensi itu sederhana. Temukan target "
"`rust_static_library` Anda, lalu tambahkan `dep` pada target `:lib` di dalam"
" crate Anda."

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/depending-on-a-crate.md
msgid "Specifically,"
msgstr "Secara khusus,"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/depending-on-a-crate.md
msgid ""
"```bob\n"
"                     +------------+      +----------------------+\n"
"\"//third_party/rust\" | crate name | \"/v\" | major semver version | \":lib\"\n"
"                     +------------+      +----------------------+\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```bob\n"
"                     +------------+      +----------------------+\n"
"\"//third_party/rust\" | crate name | \"/v\" | major semver version | \":lib\"\n"
"                     +------------+      +----------------------+\n"
"```"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/depending-on-a-crate.md
msgid ""
"```gn\n"
"rust_static_library(\"my_rust_lib\") {\n"
"  crate_root = \"lib.rs\"\n"
"  sources = [ \"lib.rs\" ]\n"
"  deps = [ \"//third_party/rust/example_rust_crate/v1:lib\" ]\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```gn\n"
"rust_static_library(\"my_rust_lib\") {\n"
"  crate_root = \"lib.rs\"\n"
"  sources = [ \"lib.rs\" ]\n"
"  deps = [ \"//third_party/rust/example_rust_crate/v1:lib\" ]\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/reviews-and-audits.md
msgid "Auditing Third Party Crates"
msgstr "Mengaudit Crate Pihak Ketiga"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/reviews-and-audits.md
msgid ""
"Adding new libraries is subject to Chromium's standard "
"[policies](https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/refs/heads/main/docs/rust.md#Third_party-"
"review), but of course also subject to security review. As you may be "
"bringing in not just a single crate but also transitive dependencies, there "
"may be a substantial amount of code to review. On the other hand, safe Rust "
"code can have limited negative side effects. How should you review it?"
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan library baru tunduk pada "
"[kebijakan](https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/refs/heads/main/docs/rust.md#Third_party-"
"review) standar Chromium, tetapi tentu juga tunduk pada review keamanan. "
"Karena Anda mungkin tidak hanya memasukkan satu crate tetapi juga dependensi"
" transitif, jumlah kode yang harus ditinjau bisa cukup banyak. Di sisi lain,"
" kode Rust safe dapat memiliki efek samping negatif yang terbatas. Bagaimana"
" Anda harus meninjaunya?"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/reviews-and-audits.md
msgid ""
"Over time Chromium aims to move to a process based around [cargo "
"vet](https://mozilla.github.io/cargo-vet/)."
msgstr ""
"Seiring waktu, Chromium bertujuan beralih ke proses berbasis [cargo "
"vet](https://mozilla.github.io/cargo-vet/)."

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/reviews-and-audits.md
msgid ""
"Meanwhile, for each new crate addition, we are checking for the following:"
msgstr ""
"Sementara itu, untuk setiap penambahan crate baru, kami memeriksa hal "
"berikut:"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/reviews-and-audits.md
msgid ""
"Understand why each crate is used. What's the relationship between crates? "
"If the build system for each crate contains a `build.rs` or procedural "
"macros, work out what they're for. Are they compatible with the way Chromium"
" is normally built?"
msgstr ""
"Pahami mengapa setiap crate digunakan. Apa hubungan antarcrate? Jika sistem "
"build setiap crate berisi `build.rs` atau macro prosedural, pahami "
"tujuannya. Apakah keduanya kompatibel dengan cara Chromium biasanya "
"dibangun?"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/reviews-and-audits.md
msgid "Check each crate seems to be reasonably well maintained"
msgstr "Periksa apakah setiap crate tampak dipelihara dengan cukup baik"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/reviews-and-audits.md
msgid ""
"Use `cd third-party/rust/chromium_crates_io; cargo audit` to check for known"
" vulnerabilities (first you'll need to `cargo install cargo-audit`, which "
"ironically involves downloading lots of dependencies from the "
"internet[2](../cargo.md))"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan `cd third-party/rust/chromium_crates_io; cargo audit` untuk "
"memeriksa kerentanan yang diketahui (pertama Anda perlu `cargo install "
"cargo-audit`, yang ironisnya melibatkan pengunduhan banyak dependensi dari "
"internet[2](../cargo.md))"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/reviews-and-audits.md
msgid ""
"Ensure any `unsafe` code is good enough for the [Rule of "
"Two](https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/main/docs/security/rule-"
"of-2.md#unsafe-code-in-safe-languages)"
msgstr ""
"Pastikan kode `unsafe` apa pun cukup baik untuk [Rule of "
"Two](https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/main/docs/security/rule-"
"of-2.md#unsafe-code-in-safe-languages)"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/reviews-and-audits.md
msgid "Check for any use of `fs` or `net` APIs"
msgstr "Periksa penggunaan API `fs` atau `net`"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/reviews-and-audits.md
msgid ""
"Read all the code at a sufficient level to look for anything out of place "
"that might have been maliciously inserted. (You can't realistically aim for "
"100% perfection here: there is often too much code.)"
msgstr ""
"Baca semua kode pada tingkat yang memadai untuk mencari hal yang tidak pada "
"tempatnya yang mungkin disisipkan secara jahat. (Anda tidak dapat secara "
"realistis menargetkan kesempurnaan 100% di sini: sering kali kodenya terlalu"
" banyak.)"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/reviews-and-audits.md
msgid ""
"These are just guidelines --- work with reviewers from "
"`security@chromium.org` to work out the right way to become confident of the"
" crate."
msgstr ""
"Ini hanyalah pedoman --- bekerja samalah dengan reviewer dari "
"`security@chromium.org` untuk menentukan cara yang tepat agar yakin terhadap"
" crate tersebut."

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/checking-in.md
msgid "Checking Crates into Chromium Source Code"
msgstr "Memasukkan Crate ke Kode Sumber Chromium"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/checking-in.md
msgid "`git status` should reveal:"
msgstr "`git status` seharusnya menunjukkan:"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/checking-in.md
msgid "Crate code in `//third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io`"
msgstr "Kode crate di `//third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io`"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/checking-in.md
msgid ""
"Metadata (`BUILD.gn` and `README.chromium`) in "
"`//third_party/rust/<crate>/<version>`"
msgstr ""
"Metadata (`BUILD.gn` dan `README.chromium`) di "
"`//third_party/rust/<crate>/<version>`"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/checking-in.md
msgid "Please also add an `OWNERS` file in the latter location."
msgstr "Silakan juga tambahkan berkas `OWNERS` di lokasi terakhir."

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/checking-in.md
msgid ""
"You should land all this, along with your `Cargo.toml` and "
"`gnrt_config.toml` changes, into the Chromium repo."
msgstr ""
"Anda sebaiknya memasukkan semua ini, bersama perubahan `Cargo.toml` dan "
"`gnrt_config.toml` Anda, ke repositori Chromium."

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/checking-in.md
msgid ""
"**Important:** you need to use `git add -f` because otherwise `.gitignore` "
"files may result in some files being skipped."
msgstr ""
"**Penting:** Anda perlu menggunakan `git add -f` karena jika tidak, berkas "
"`.gitignore` dapat menyebabkan sebagian berkas dilewati."

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/checking-in.md
msgid ""
"As you do so, you might find presubmit checks fail because of non-inclusive "
"language. This is because Rust crate data tends to include names of git "
"branches, and many projects still use non-inclusive terminology there. So "
"you may need to run:"
msgstr ""
"Saat melakukannya, Anda mungkin menemukan pemeriksaan presubmit gagal karena"
" bahasa yang tidak inklusif. Ini karena data crate Rust cenderung "
"menyertakan nama branch git, dan banyak proyek masih menggunakan terminologi"
" yang tidak inklusif di sana. Jadi Anda mungkin perlu menjalankan:"

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/keeping-up-to-date.md
msgid ""
"As the OWNER of any third party Chromium dependency, you are [expected to "
"keep it up to date with any security "
"fixes](https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/main/docs/adding_to_third_party.md#add-"
"owners). It is hoped that we will soon automate this for Rust crates, but "
"for now, it's still your responsibility just as it is for any other third "
"party dependency."
msgstr ""
"Sebagai OWNER dependensi pihak ketiga Chromium, Anda [diharapkan menjaganya "
"tetap mutakhir dengan perbaikan keamanan apa "
"pun](https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/main/docs/adding_to_third_party.md#add-"
"owners). Diharapkan kami segera mengotomatiskan hal ini untuk crate Rust, "
"tetapi untuk saat ini, ini masih menjadi tanggung jawab Anda seperti halnya "
"dependensi pihak ketiga lainnya."

#: src/exercises/chromium/third-party.md
msgid ""
"Add [uwuify](https://crates.io/crates/uwuify) to Chromium, turning off the "
"crate's [default features](https://doc.rust-"
"lang.org/cargo/reference/features.html#the-default-feature). Assume that the"
" crate will be used in shipping Chromium, but won't be used to handle "
"untrustworthy input."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan [uwuify](https://crates.io/crates/uwuify) ke Chromium, dengan "
"menonaktifkan [fitur default](https://doc.rust-"
"lang.org/cargo/reference/features.html#the-default-feature) crate tersebut. "
"Asumsikan crate akan digunakan dalam Chromium yang dirilis, tetapi tidak "
"akan digunakan untuk menangani input yang tidak tepercaya."

#: src/exercises/chromium/third-party.md
msgid ""
"(In the next exercise we'll use uwuify from Chromium, but feel free to skip "
"ahead and do that now if you like. Or, you could create a new "
"[`rust_executable` "
"target](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:build/rust/rust_executable.gni)"
" which uses `uwuify`)."
msgstr ""
"(Pada latihan berikutnya kami akan menggunakan uwuify dari Chromium, tetapi "
"silakan melompat ke depan dan melakukannya sekarang jika Anda mau. Atau, "
"Anda dapat membuat [target `rust_executable` "
"baru](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:build/rust/rust_executable.gni)"
" yang menggunakan `uwuify`)."

#: src/exercises/chromium/third-party.md
msgid "Students will need to download lots of transitive dependencies."
msgstr "Siswa perlu mengunduh banyak dependensi transitif."

#: src/exercises/chromium/third-party.md
msgid "The total crates needed are:"
msgstr "Total crate yang diperlukan adalah:"

#: src/exercises/chromium/third-party.md
msgid "`instant`,"
msgstr "`instant`,"

#: src/exercises/chromium/third-party.md
msgid "`lock_api`,"
msgstr "`lock_api`,"

#: src/exercises/chromium/third-party.md
msgid "`parking_lot`,"
msgstr "`parking_lot`,"

#: src/exercises/chromium/third-party.md
msgid "`parking_lot_core`,"
msgstr "`parking_lot_core`,"

#: src/exercises/chromium/third-party.md
msgid "`redox_syscall`,"
msgstr "`redox_syscall`,"

#: src/exercises/chromium/third-party.md
msgid "`scopeguard`,"
msgstr "`scopeguard`,"

#: src/exercises/chromium/third-party.md
msgid "`smallvec`, and"
msgstr "`smallvec`, dan"

#: src/exercises/chromium/third-party.md
msgid "`uwuify`."
msgstr "`uwuify`."

#: src/exercises/chromium/third-party.md
msgid ""
"If students are downloading even more than that, they likely forgot to turn "
"off the default features."
msgstr ""
"Jika siswa mengunduh lebih banyak dari itu, kemungkinan mereka lupa "
"menonaktifkan fitur default."

#: src/exercises/chromium/third-party.md
msgid ""
"Thanks to [Daniel Liu](https://github.com/Daniel-Liu-c0deb0t) for this "
"crate!"
msgstr ""
"Terima kasih kepada [Daniel Liu](https://github.com/Daniel-Liu-c0deb0t) "
"untuk crate ini!"

#: src/exercises/chromium/bringing-it-together.md
msgid "Bringing It Together --- Exercise"
msgstr "Menyatukan Semuanya --- Latihan"

#: src/exercises/chromium/bringing-it-together.md
msgid ""
"In this exercise, you're going to add a whole new Chromium feature, bringing"
" together everything you already learned."
msgstr ""
"Dalam latihan ini, Anda akan menambahkan fitur Chromium yang sepenuhnya "
"baru, menyatukan semua yang telah Anda pelajari."

#: src/exercises/chromium/bringing-it-together.md
msgid "The Brief from Product Management"
msgstr "Ringkasan dari Product Management"

#: src/exercises/chromium/bringing-it-together.md
msgid ""
"A community of pixies has been discovered living in a remote rainforest. "
"It's important that we get Chromium for Pixies delivered to them as soon as "
"possible."
msgstr ""
"Komunitas pixie telah ditemukan hidup di hutan hujan terpencil. Penting bagi"
" kami untuk mengirimkan Chromium for Pixies kepada mereka secepat mungkin."

#: src/exercises/chromium/bringing-it-together.md
msgid ""
"The requirement is to translate all Chromium's UI strings into Pixie "
"language."
msgstr ""
"Persyaratannya adalah menerjemahkan semua string UI Chromium ke bahasa "
"Pixie."

#: src/exercises/chromium/bringing-it-together.md
msgid ""
"There's not time to wait for proper translations, but fortunately pixie "
"language is very close to English, and it turns out there's a Rust crate "
"which does the translation."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ada waktu untuk menunggu terjemahan yang layak, tetapi untungnya "
"bahasa pixie sangat dekat dengan bahasa Inggris, dan ternyata ada crate Rust"
" yang melakukan terjemahan tersebut."

#: src/exercises/chromium/bringing-it-together.md
msgid ""
"In fact, you already [imported that crate in the previous "
"exercise](https://crates.io/crates/uwuify)."
msgstr ""
"Bahkan, Anda sudah [mengimpor crate tersebut pada latihan "
"sebelumnya](https://crates.io/crates/uwuify)."

#: src/exercises/chromium/bringing-it-together.md
msgid ""
"(Obviously, real translations of Chrome require incredible care and "
"diligence. Don't ship this!)"
msgstr ""
"(Jelas, terjemahan Chrome yang sebenarnya memerlukan kecermatan dan "
"ketekunan luar biasa. Jangan rilis ini!)"

#: src/exercises/chromium/bringing-it-together.md
msgid "Steps"
msgstr "Langkah-Langkah"

#: src/exercises/chromium/bringing-it-together.md
msgid ""
"Modify `ResourceBundle::MaybeMangleLocalizedString` so that it uwuifies all "
"strings before display. In this special build of Chromium, it should always "
"do this irrespective of the setting of `mangle_localized_strings_`."
msgstr ""
"Ubah `ResourceBundle::MaybeMangleLocalizedString` agar melakukan uwuify pada"
" semua string sebelum ditampilkan. Pada build Chromium khusus ini, fungsi "
"tersebut seharusnya selalu melakukan ini terlepas dari pengaturan "
"`mangle_localized_strings_`."

#: src/exercises/chromium/bringing-it-together.md
msgid ""
"If you've done everything right across all these exercises, congratulations,"
" you should have created Chrome for pixies!"
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda telah melakukan semuanya dengan benar di seluruh latihan ini, "
"selamat, Anda seharusnya telah membuat Chrome untuk pixie!"

#: src/exercises/chromium/bringing-it-together.md
msgid ""
"UTF-16 vs UTF-8. Students should be aware that Rust strings are always "
"UTF-8, and will typically decide that it's better to do the conversion on "
"the C++ side using `base::UTF16ToUTF8` and back again."
msgstr ""
"UTF-16 vs UTF-8. Siswa sebaiknya memahami bahwa string Rust selalu UTF-8, "
"dan biasanya akan memutuskan bahwa lebih baik melakukan konversi di sisi C++"
" menggunakan `base::UTF16ToUTF8` lalu kembali lagi."

#: src/exercises/chromium/bringing-it-together.md
msgid ""
"If students decide to do the conversion on the Rust side, they'll need to "
"consider [`String::from_utf16`](https://doc.rust-"
"lang.org/std/string/struct.String.html#method.from_utf16), consider error "
"handling, and consider which [CXX supported types can transfer many "
"u16s](https://cxx.rs/binding/slice.html)."
msgstr ""
"Jika siswa memutuskan melakukan konversi di sisi Rust, mereka perlu "
"mempertimbangkan [`String::from_utf16`](https://doc.rust-"
"lang.org/std/string/struct.String.html#method.from_utf16), mempertimbangkan "
"penanganan error, dan mempertimbangkan [tipe yang didukung CXX yang dapat "
"mentransfer banyak u16](https://cxx.rs/binding/slice.html)."

#: src/exercises/chromium/bringing-it-together.md
msgid ""
"Students may design the C++/Rust boundary in several different ways, e.g. "
"taking and returning strings by value, or taking a mutable reference to a "
"string. If a mutable reference is used, CXX will likely tell the student "
"that they need to use [`Pin`](https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/pin/). You may "
"need to explain what `Pin` does, and then explain why CXX needs it for "
"mutable references to C++ data: the answer is that C++ data can't be moved "
"around like Rust data, because it may contain self-referential pointers."
msgstr ""
"Siswa dapat merancang batas C++/Rust dengan beberapa cara berbeda, misalnya "
"menerima dan mengembalikan string by value, atau menerima mutable reference "
"ke string. Jika mutable reference digunakan, CXX kemungkinan akan memberi "
"tahu siswa bahwa mereka perlu menggunakan [`Pin`](https://doc.rust-"
"lang.org/std/pin/). Anda mungkin perlu menjelaskan apa yang dilakukan `Pin`,"
" lalu menjelaskan mengapa CXX memerlukannya untuk mutable reference ke data "
"C++: jawabannya adalah data C++ tidak dapat dipindahkan seperti data Rust, "
"karena mungkin berisi pointer yang mereferensikan dirinya sendiri."

#: src/exercises/chromium/bringing-it-together.md
msgid ""
"The C++ target containing `ResourceBundle::MaybeMangleLocalizedString` will "
"need to depend on a `rust_static_library` target. The student likely already"
" did this."
msgstr ""
"Target C++ yang berisi `ResourceBundle::MaybeMangleLocalizedString` perlu "
"bergantung pada target `rust_static_library`. Siswa kemungkinan sudah "
"melakukannya."

#: src/exercises/chromium/bringing-it-together.md
msgid ""
"The `rust_static_library` target will need to depend on "
"`//third_party/rust/uwuify/v0_2:lib`."
msgstr ""
"Target `rust_static_library` perlu bergantung pada "
"`//third_party/rust/uwuify/v0_2:lib`."

#: src/exercises/chromium/solutions.md
msgid ""
"Solutions to the Chromium exercises can be found in [this series of "
"CLs](https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/5096560)."
msgstr ""
"Solusi latihan Chromium dapat ditemukan di [rangkaian CL "
"ini](https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/5096560)."

#: src/exercises/chromium/solutions.md
msgid ""
"Or, if you'd prefer \"standalone\" solutions that don't require applying "
"patchsets or integration with core Chromium code, you can find them in the "
"[`//chromium/src/codelabs/rust` subdirectory in "
"Chromium](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:codelabs/rust/)."
msgstr ""
"Atau, jika Anda lebih memilih solusi \"mandiri\" yang tidak memerlukan "
"penerapan patchset atau integrasi dengan kode inti Chromium, Anda dapat "
"menemukannya di [subdirektori `//chromium/src/codelabs/rust` di "
"Chromium](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:codelabs/rust/)."

#: src/bare-metal.md
msgid "Welcome to Bare Metal Rust"
msgstr "Selamat Datang di Bare Metal Rust"

#: src/bare-metal.md
msgid ""
"This is a standalone one-day course about bare-metal Rust, aimed at people "
"who are familiar with the basics of Rust (perhaps from completing the "
"Comprehensive Rust course), and ideally also have some experience with bare-"
"metal programming in some other language such as C."
msgstr ""
"Ini adalah kursus satu hari mandiri tentang bare-metal Rust, ditujukan bagi "
"orang yang sudah mengenal dasar-dasar Rust (mungkin dari menyelesaikan "
"kursus Comprehensive Rust), dan idealnya juga memiliki pengalaman "
"pemrograman bare-metal dalam bahasa lain seperti C."

#: src/bare-metal.md
msgid ""
"Today we will talk about 'bare-metal' Rust: running Rust code without an OS "
"underneath us. This will be divided into several parts:"
msgstr ""
"Hari ini kita akan membahas Rust 'bare-metal': menjalankan kode Rust tanpa "
"OS di bawahnya. Pembahasan akan dibagi menjadi beberapa bagian:"

#: src/bare-metal.md
msgid "What is `no_std` Rust?"
msgstr "Apa Itu Rust `no_std`?"

#: src/bare-metal.md
msgid "Writing firmware for microcontrollers."
msgstr "Menulis firmware untuk mikrokontroler."

#: src/bare-metal.md
msgid "Writing bootloader / kernel code for application processors."
msgstr "Menulis kode bootloader / kernel untuk prosesor aplikasi."

#: src/bare-metal.md
msgid "Some useful crates for bare-metal Rust development."
msgstr "Beberapa crate berguna untuk pengembangan Rust bare-metal."

#: src/bare-metal.md
msgid ""
"For the microcontroller part of the course we will use the [BBC "
"micro:bit](https://microbit.org/) v2 as an example. It's a [development "
"board](https://tech.microbit.org/hardware/) based on the Nordic nRF52833 "
"microcontroller with some LEDs and buttons, an I2C-connected accelerometer "
"and compass, and an on-board SWD debugger."
msgstr ""
"Untuk bagian mikrokontroler dalam kursus, kami akan menggunakan [BBC "
"micro:bit](https://microbit.org/) v2 sebagai contoh. Ini adalah [development"
" board](https://tech.microbit.org/hardware/) berbasis mikrokontroler Nordic "
"nRF52833 dengan beberapa LED dan tombol, accelerometer dan kompas yang "
"terhubung I2C, serta debugger SWD onboard."

#: src/bare-metal.md
msgid ""
"To get started, install some tools we'll need later. On gLinux or Debian:"
msgstr ""
"Untuk memulai, pasang beberapa alat yang akan kami perlukan nanti. Di gLinux"
" atau Debian:"

#: src/bare-metal.md
msgid ""
"And give users in the `plugdev` group access to the micro:bit programmer:"
msgstr ""
"Dan berikan pengguna dalam grup `plugdev` akses ke programmer micro:bit:"

#: src/bare-metal.md
msgid ""
"You should see \"NXP ARM mbed\" in the output of `lsusb` if the device is "
"available. If you are using a Linux environment on a Chromebook, you will "
"need to share the USB device with Linux, via `chrome://os-"
"settings/crostini/sharedUsbDevices`."
msgstr ""
"Anda seharusnya melihat \"NXP ARM mbed\" pada output `lsusb` jika perangkat "
"tersedia. Jika Anda menggunakan lingkungan Linux di Chromebook, Anda perlu "
"membagikan perangkat USB ke Linux melalui `chrome://os-"
"settings/crostini/sharedUsbDevices`."

