#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/pacs.md
msgid "Peripheral Access Crates"
msgstr "Peripheral Access Crate"

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/pacs.md
msgid ""
"[`svd2rust`](https://crates.io/crates/svd2rust) generates mostly-safe Rust "
"wrappers for memory-mapped peripherals from [CMSIS-"
"SVD](https://www.keil.com/pack/doc/CMSIS/SVD/html/index.html) files."
msgstr ""
"[`svd2rust`](https://crates.io/crates/svd2rust) menghasilkan wrapper Rust "
"yang sebagian besar safe untuk peripheral memory-mapped dari berkas [CMSIS-"
"SVD](https://www.keil.com/pack/doc/CMSIS/SVD/html/index.html)."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/pacs.md
msgid ""
"SVD (System View Description) files are XML files typically provided by "
"silicon vendors that describe the memory map of the device."
msgstr ""
"Berkas SVD (System View Description) adalah berkas XML yang biasanya "
"disediakan vendor silikon yang mendeskripsikan memory map perangkat."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/pacs.md
msgid ""
"They are organized by peripheral, register, field and value, with names, "
"descriptions, addresses and so on."
msgstr ""
"Berkas tersebut diorganisasikan menurut peripheral, register, field, dan "
"value, dengan nama, deskripsi, alamat, dan sebagainya."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/pacs.md
msgid ""
"SVD files are frequently buggy and incomplete, so there are various projects"
" that patch the mistakes, add missing details, and publish the generated "
"crates."
msgstr ""
"Berkas SVD sering memiliki bug dan tidak lengkap, sehingga ada berbagai "
"proyek yang menambal kesalahan, menambahkan detail yang hilang, dan "
"menerbitkan crate yang dihasilkan."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/pacs.md
msgid "`cortex-m-rt` provides the vector table, among other things."
msgstr "`cortex-m-rt` menyediakan vector table, antara lain."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/pacs.md
msgid ""
"If you `cargo install cargo-binutils` then you can run `cargo objdump --bin "
"pac -- -d --no-show-raw-insn` to see the resulting binary."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda menjalankan `cargo install cargo-binutils`, Anda dapat menjalankan"
" `cargo objdump --bin pac -- -d --no-show-raw-insn` untuk melihat binary "
"yang dihasilkan."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/hals.md
msgid "HAL crates"
msgstr "Crate HAL"

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/hals.md
msgid ""
"[HAL crates](https://github.com/rust-embedded/awesome-embedded-rust#hal-"
"implementation-crates) for many microcontrollers provide wrappers around "
"various peripherals. These generally implement traits from [`embedded-"
"hal`](https://crates.io/crates/embedded-hal)."
msgstr ""
"[Crate HAL](https://github.com/rust-embedded/awesome-embedded-rust#hal-"
"implementation-crates) untuk banyak mikrokontroler menyediakan wrapper untuk"
" berbagai peripheral. Crate ini umumnya mengimplementasikan trait dari "
"[`embedded-hal`](https://crates.io/crates/embedded-hal)."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/hals.md
msgid "// Create HAL wrapper for GPIO port 0.\n"
msgstr "// Create HAL wrapper for GPIO port 0.\n"

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/hals.md
msgid ""
"`set_low` and `set_high` are methods on the `embedded_hal` `OutputPin` "
"trait."
msgstr ""
"`set_low` dan `set_high` adalah method pada trait `OutputPin` dari "
"`embedded_hal`."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/hals.md
msgid ""
"HAL crates exist for many Cortex-M and RISC-V devices, including various "
"STM32, GD32, nRF, NXP, MSP430, AVR and PIC microcontrollers."
msgstr ""
"Crate HAL tersedia untuk banyak perangkat Cortex-M dan RISC-V, termasuk "
"berbagai mikrokontroler STM32, GD32, nRF, NXP, MSP430, AVR, dan PIC."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/board-support.md
msgid "Board support crates"
msgstr "Crate Board Support"

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/board-support.md
msgid ""
"Board support crates provide a further level of wrapping for a specific "
"board for convenience."
msgstr ""
"Crate board support menyediakan tingkat pembungkusan lebih lanjut untuk "
"board tertentu demi kemudahan."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/board-support.md
msgid ""
"In this case the board support crate is just providing more useful names, "
"and a bit of initialization."
msgstr ""
"Dalam kasus ini crate board support hanya menyediakan nama yang lebih "
"berguna, dan sedikit inisialisasi."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/board-support.md
msgid ""
"The crate may also include drivers for some on-board devices outside of the "
"microcontroller itself."
msgstr ""
"Crate ini juga dapat menyertakan driver untuk beberapa perangkat onboard di "
"luar mikrokontroler itu sendiri."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/board-support.md
msgid "`microbit-v2` includes a simple driver for the LED matrix."
msgstr "`microbit-v2` menyertakan driver sederhana untuk matriks LED."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/type-state.md
msgid "The type state pattern"
msgstr "Pola type state"

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/type-state.md
msgid "// let gpio0_01_again = gpio0.p0_01; // Error, moved.\n"
msgstr "// let gpio0_01_again = gpio0.p0_01; // Error, moved.\n"

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/type-state.md
msgid "// pin_input.is_high(); // Error, moved.\n"
msgstr "// pin_input.is_high(); // Error, moved.\n"

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/type-state.md
msgid ""
"Pins don't implement `Copy` or `Clone`, so only one instance of each can "
"exist. Once a pin is moved out of the port struct, nobody else can take it."
msgstr ""
"Pin tidak mengimplementasikan `Copy` atau `Clone`, sehingga hanya satu "
"instance dari setiap pin yang dapat ada. Setelah pin dipindahkan keluar dari"
" struct port, tidak ada pihak lain yang dapat mengambilnya."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/type-state.md
msgid ""
"Changing the configuration of a pin consumes the old pin instance, so you "
"can't use the old instance afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Mengubah konfigurasi pin mengonsumsi instance pin lama, sehingga Anda tidak "
"dapat menggunakan instance lama setelahnya."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/type-state.md
msgid ""
"The type of a value indicates the state it is in: e.g., in this case, the "
"configuration state of a GPIO pin. This encodes the state machine into the "
"type system and ensures that you don't try to use a pin in a certain way "
"without properly configuring it first. Illegal state transitions are caught "
"at compile time."
msgstr ""
"Tipe suatu nilai menunjukkan state tempat nilai itu berada: misalnya, dalam "
"kasus ini, state konfigurasi pin GPIO. Ini mengodekan state machine ke dalam"
" sistem tipe dan memastikan Anda tidak mencoba menggunakan pin dengan cara "
"tertentu tanpa mengonfigurasinya terlebih dahulu dengan benar. Transisi "
"state yang ilegal tertangkap pada waktu kompilasi."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/type-state.md
msgid ""
"You can call `is_high` on an input pin and `set_high` on an output pin, but "
"not vice-versa."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat memanggil `is_high` pada pin input dan `set_high` pada pin "
"output, tetapi tidak sebaliknya."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/type-state.md
msgid "Many HAL crates follow this pattern."
msgstr "Banyak crate HAL mengikuti pola ini."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/embedded-hal.md
msgid ""
"The [`embedded-hal`](https://crates.io/crates/embedded-hal) crate provides a"
" number of traits covering common microcontroller peripherals:"
msgstr ""
"Crate [`embedded-hal`](https://crates.io/crates/embedded-hal) menyediakan "
"sejumlah trait yang mencakup peripheral mikrokontroler umum:"

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/embedded-hal.md
msgid "GPIO"
msgstr "GPIO"

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/embedded-hal.md
msgid "PWM"
msgstr "PWM"

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/embedded-hal.md
msgid "Delay timers"
msgstr "Delay timer"

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/embedded-hal.md
msgid "I2C and SPI buses and devices"
msgstr "Bus dan perangkat I2C dan SPI"

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/embedded-hal.md
msgid ""
"Similar traits for byte streams (e.g. UARTs), CAN buses and RNGs are broken "
"out into [`embedded-io`](https://crates.io/crates/embedded-io), [`embedded-"
"can`](https://crates.io/crates/embedded-can) and "
"[`rand_core`](https://crates.io/crates/rand_core) respectively."
msgstr ""
"Trait serupa untuk byte stream (misalnya UART), bus CAN, dan RNG dipisahkan "
"ke [`embedded-io`](https://crates.io/crates/embedded-io), [`embedded-"
"can`](https://crates.io/crates/embedded-can), dan "
"[`rand_core`](https://crates.io/crates/rand_core)."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/embedded-hal.md
msgid ""
"Other crates then implement [drivers](https://github.com/rust-"
"embedded/awesome-embedded-rust#driver-crates) in terms of these traits, e.g."
" an accelerometer driver might need an I2C or SPI device instance."
msgstr ""
"Crate lain kemudian mengimplementasikan [driver](https://github.com/rust-"
"embedded/awesome-embedded-rust#driver-crates) berdasarkan trait tersebut, "
"misalnya driver accelerometer mungkin memerlukan instance perangkat I2C atau"
" SPI."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/embedded-hal.md
msgid ""
"The traits cover using the peripherals but not initializing or configuring "
"them, as initialization and configuration is highly platform-specific."
msgstr ""
"Trait tersebut mencakup penggunaan peripheral tetapi tidak inisialisasi atau"
" konfigurasinya, karena inisialisasi dan konfigurasi sangat spesifik "
"platform."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/embedded-hal.md
msgid ""
"There are implementations for many microcontrollers, as well as other "
"platforms such as Linux on Raspberry Pi."
msgstr ""
"Tersedia implementasi untuk banyak mikrokontroler, serta platform lain "
"seperti Linux pada Raspberry Pi."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/embedded-hal.md
msgid ""
"[`embedded-hal-async`](https://crates.io/crates/embedded-hal-async) provides"
" async versions of the traits."
msgstr ""
"[`embedded-hal-async`](https://crates.io/crates/embedded-hal-async) "
"menyediakan versi async dari trait tersebut."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/embedded-hal.md
msgid ""
"[`embedded-hal-nb`](https://crates.io/crates/embedded-hal-nb) provides "
"another approach to non-blocking I/O, based on the "
"[`nb`](https://crates.io/crates/nb) crate."
msgstr ""
"[`embedded-hal-nb`](https://crates.io/crates/embedded-hal-nb) menyediakan "
"pendekatan lain untuk I/O non-blocking, berdasarkan crate "
"[`nb`](https://crates.io/crates/nb)."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/probe-rs.md
msgid ""
"[probe-rs](https://probe.rs/) is a handy toolset for embedded debugging, "
"like OpenOCD but better integrated."
msgstr ""
"[probe-rs](https://probe.rs/) adalah toolset praktis untuk debugging "
"embedded, seperti OpenOCD tetapi terintegrasi lebih baik."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/probe-rs.md
msgid ""
"SWD (Serial Wire Debug) and JTAG via CMSIS-DAP, ST-Link and J-Link probes"
msgstr ""
"SWD (Serial Wire Debug) dan JTAG melalui probe CMSIS-DAP, ST-Link, dan "
"J-Link"

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/probe-rs.md
msgid "GDB stub and Microsoft DAP (Debug Adapter Protocol) server"
msgstr "GDB stub dan server Microsoft DAP (Debug Adapter Protocol)"

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/probe-rs.md
msgid "Cargo integration"
msgstr "Integrasi Cargo"

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/probe-rs.md
msgid ""
"`cargo-embed` is a cargo subcommand to build and flash binaries, log RTT "
"(Real Time Transfers) output and connect GDB. It's configured by an "
"`Embed.toml` file in your project directory."
msgstr ""
"`cargo-embed` adalah subcommand cargo untuk membangun dan mem-flash binary, "
"mencatat output RTT (Real Time Transfers), dan menghubungkan GDB. "
"Konfigurasinya melalui berkas `Embed.toml` di direktori proyek Anda."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/probe-rs.md
msgid ""
"[CMSIS-DAP](https://arm-software.github.io/CMSIS_5/DAP/html/index.html) is "
"an Arm standard protocol over USB for an in-circuit debugger to access the "
"CoreSight Debug Access Port of various Arm Cortex processors. It's what the "
"on-board debugger on the BBC micro:bit uses."
msgstr ""
"[CMSIS-DAP](https://arm-software.github.io/CMSIS_5/DAP/html/index.html) "
"adalah protokol standar Arm melalui USB bagi debugger in-circuit untuk "
"mengakses CoreSight Debug Access Port pada berbagai prosesor Arm Cortex. "
"Protokol inilah yang digunakan debugger onboard pada BBC micro:bit."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/probe-rs.md
msgid ""
"ST-Link is a range of in-circuit debuggers from ST Microelectronics, J-Link "
"is a range from SEGGER."
msgstr ""
"ST-Link adalah rangkaian debugger in-circuit dari ST Microelectronics, "
"J-Link adalah rangkaian dari SEGGER."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/probe-rs.md
msgid ""
"The Debug Access Port is usually either a 5-pin JTAG interface or 2-pin "
"Serial Wire Debug."
msgstr ""
"Debug Access Port biasanya berupa antarmuka JTAG 5-pin atau Serial Wire "
"Debug 2-pin."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/probe-rs.md
msgid ""
"probe-rs is a library that you can integrate into your own tools if you want"
" to."
msgstr ""
"probe-rs adalah library yang dapat Anda integrasikan ke alat Anda sendiri "
"jika diinginkan."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/probe-rs.md
msgid ""
"The [Microsoft Debug Adapter Protocol](https://microsoft.github.io/debug-"
"adapter-protocol/) lets VSCode and other IDEs debug code running on any "
"supported microcontroller."
msgstr ""
"[Microsoft Debug Adapter Protocol](https://microsoft.github.io/debug-"
"adapter-protocol/) memungkinkan VSCode dan IDE lain men-debug kode yang "
"berjalan pada mikrokontroler yang didukung."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/probe-rs.md
msgid "cargo-embed is a binary built using the probe-rs library."
msgstr "cargo-embed adalah binary yang dibangun menggunakan library probe-rs."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/probe-rs.md
msgid ""
"RTT (Real Time Transfers) is a mechanism to transfer data between the debug "
"host and the target through a number of ring buffers."
msgstr ""
"RTT (Real Time Transfers) adalah mekanisme untuk mentransfer data antara "
"host debug dan target melalui sejumlah ring buffer."

