msgstr "Hanya Cortex-M."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/other-projects.md
msgid ""
"Google uses TockOS on the Haven microcontroller for Titan security keys."
msgstr ""
"Google menggunakan TockOS pada mikrokontroler Haven untuk security key "
"Titan."

#: src/bare-metal/microcontrollers/other-projects.md
msgid ""
"FreeRTOS is mostly written in C, but there are Rust bindings for writing "
"applications."
msgstr ""
"FreeRTOS sebagian besar ditulis dalam C, tetapi tersedia binding Rust untuk "
"menulis aplikasi."

