msgstr "Inertial Measurement Unit LSM303AGR terhubung ke bus I2C internal."

#: src/exercises/bare-metal/compass.md
msgid ""
"TWI is another name for I2C, so the I2C master peripheral is called TWIM."
msgstr ""
"TWI adalah nama lain untuk I2C, sehingga peripheral I2C master disebut TWIM."

#: src/exercises/bare-metal/compass.md
msgid ""
"The LSM303AGR driver needs something implementing the "
