"[`microbit::hal::Twim`](https://docs.rs/microbit-v2/latest/microbit/hal/struct.Twim.html)"
" struct implements this."
msgstr ""
"Driver LSM303AGR memerlukan sesuatu yang mengimplementasikan trait "
"`embedded_hal::i2c::I2c`. Struct "
"[`microbit::hal::Twim`](https://docs.rs/microbit-v2/latest/microbit/hal/struct.Twim.html)"
" mengimplementasikannya."

#: src/exercises/bare-metal/compass.md
msgid ""
"You have a "
"[`microbit::Board`](https://docs.rs/microbit-v2/latest/microbit/struct.Board.html)"
" struct with fields for the various pins and peripherals."
msgstr ""
"Anda memiliki struct "
"[`microbit::Board`](https://docs.rs/microbit-v2/latest/microbit/struct.Board.html)"
" dengan field untuk berbagai pin dan peripheral."

#: src/exercises/bare-metal/compass.md
msgid ""
"You can also look at the [nRF52833 "
"datasheet](https://infocenter.nordicsemi.com/pdf/nRF52833_PS_v1.5.pdf) if "
"you want, but it shouldn't be necessary for this exercise."
msgstr ""
"Anda juga dapat melihat [datasheet "
"nRF52833](https://infocenter.nordicsemi.com/pdf/nRF52833_PS_v1.5.pdf) jika "
"mau, tetapi seharusnya tidak diperlukan untuk latihan ini."

