#: src/bare-metal/aps/better-uart.md
msgid "A better UART driver"
msgstr "Driver UART yang Lebih Baik"

#: src/bare-metal/aps/better-uart.md
msgid ""
"The PL011 actually has [more "
"registers](https://developer.arm.com/documentation/ddi0183/g/programmers-"
"model/summary-of-registers), and adding offsets to construct pointers to "
"access them is error-prone and hard to read. Additionally, some of them are "
"bit fields, which would be nice to access in a structured way."
msgstr ""
"PL011 sebenarnya memiliki [lebih banyak "
"register](https://developer.arm.com/documentation/ddi0183/g/programmers-"
"model/summary-of-registers), dan menambahkan offset untuk membangun pointer "
"guna mengaksesnya rawan error dan sulit dibaca. Selain itu, sebagian "
"register merupakan bit field, yang akan lebih baik diakses secara "
"terstruktur."

