#: src/bare-metal/aps/other-projects.md
msgid ""
"Some caveats around cache maintenance and initialization in Rust, not "
"necessarily a good example to copy for production code."
msgstr ""
"Ada beberapa peringatan seputar pemeliharaan cache dan inisialisasi di Rust,"
" sehingga belum tentu contoh yang baik untuk disalin ke kode produksi."

#: src/bare-metal/aps/other-projects.md
