#: src/concurrency/async/state-machine.md
msgid ""
"Calling an async function does nothing but construct and return a future."
msgstr ""
"Memanggil fungsi async tidak melakukan apa pun selain membangun dan "
"mengembalikan future."

#: src/concurrency/async/state-machine.md
msgid ""
"All local variables are stored in the function's future, using an enum to "
"identify where execution is currently suspended."
msgstr ""
"Semua variabel lokal disimpan dalam future fungsi, menggunakan enum untuk "
"mengidentifikasi di mana eksekusi saat ini ditangguhkan."

#: src/concurrency/async/state-machine.md
msgid ""
"An `.await` in the async function is translated into an a new state "
"containing all live variables and the awaited future. The `loop` then "
"handles that updated state, polling the future until it returns "
"`Poll::Ready`."
msgstr ""
"`.await` dalam fungsi async diterjemahkan menjadi state baru yang berisi "
"semua variabel live dan future yang ditunggu. `loop` kemudian menangani "
"state yang diperbarui tersebut, melakukan poll pada future hingga "
"mengembalikan `Poll::Ready`."

#: src/concurrency/async/state-machine.md
msgid ""
"Execution continues eagerly until a `Poll::Pending` occurs. In this simple "
"example, every future is ready immediately."
msgstr ""
"Eksekusi berlanjut secara eager hingga `Poll::Pending` terjadi. Dalam contoh"
" sederhana ini, setiap future langsung siap."

#: src/concurrency/async/state-machine.md
msgid ""
"`main` contains a naïve executor, which just busy-loops until the future is "
"ready. We will discuss real executors shortly."
msgstr ""
"`main` berisi executor naif, yang hanya busy-loop hingga future siap. Kami "
"akan membahas executor sungguhan sebentar lagi."

#: src/concurrency/async/state-machine.md
msgid ""
"Imagine the `Future` data structure for a deeply nested stack of async "
"functions. Each function's `Future` contains the `Future` structures for the"
" functions it calls. This can result in unexpectedly large compiler-"
"generated `Future` types."
msgstr ""
"Bayangkan struktur data `Future` untuk tumpukan fungsi async yang bersarang "
"dalam. `Future` setiap fungsi berisi struktur `Future` untuk fungsi yang "
"dipanggilnya. Ini dapat menghasilkan tipe `Future` yang dihasilkan compiler "
"dengan ukuran tak terduga besar."

