#: src/concurrency/async/runtimes.md
msgid ""
"A _runtime_ provides support for performing operations asynchronously (a "
"_reactor_) and is responsible for executing futures (an _executor_). Rust "
"does not have a \"built-in\" runtime, but several options are available:"
msgstr ""
"Sebuah _runtime_ menyediakan dukungan untuk menjalankan operasi secara "
"asinkron (sebuah _reactor_) dan bertanggung jawab mengeksekusi future "
"(sebuah _executor_). Rust tidak memiliki runtime \"bawaan\", tetapi tersedia"
" beberapa opsi:"

#: src/concurrency/async/runtimes.md
msgid ""
"[Tokio](https://tokio.rs/): performant, with a well-developed ecosystem of "
"functionality like [Hyper](https://hyper.rs/) for HTTP or "
"[Tonic](https://github.com/hyperium/tonic) for gRPC."
msgstr ""
"[Tokio](https://tokio.rs/): berperforma tinggi, dengan ekosistem "
"fungsionalitas yang matang seperti [Hyper](https://hyper.rs/) untuk HTTP "
"atau [Tonic](https://github.com/hyperium/tonic) untuk gRPC."

#: src/concurrency/async/runtimes.md
msgid "[smol](https://docs.rs/smol/latest/smol/): simple and lightweight"
msgstr "[smol](https://docs.rs/smol/latest/smol/): sederhana dan ringan"

#: src/concurrency/async/runtimes.md
msgid ""
"Several larger applications have their own runtimes. For example, "
"[Fuchsia](https://fuchsia.googlesource.com/fuchsia/+/refs/heads/main/src/lib/fuchsia-"
"async/src/lib.rs) already has one."
msgstr ""
"Beberapa aplikasi yang lebih besar memiliki runtime sendiri. Misalnya, "
"[Fuchsia](https://fuchsia.googlesource.com/fuchsia/+/refs/heads/main/src/lib/fuchsia-"
"async/src/lib.rs) sudah memilikinya."

#: src/concurrency/async/runtimes.md
msgid ""
"Note that of the listed runtimes, only Tokio is supported in the Rust "
"playground. The playground also does not permit any I/O, so most interesting"
" async things can't run in the playground."
msgstr ""
"Perhatikan bahwa dari runtime yang tercantum, hanya Tokio yang didukung di "
"Rust Playground. Playground juga tidak mengizinkan I/O apa pun, sehingga "
"sebagian besar hal async yang menarik tidak dapat berjalan di Playground."

#: src/concurrency/async/runtimes.md
msgid ""
"Futures are \"inert\" in that they do not do anything (not even start an I/O"
" operation) unless there is an executor polling them. This differs from JS "
"Promises, for example, which will run to completion even if they are never "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Future bersifat \"inert\" karena tidak melakukan apa pun (bahkan tidak "
"memulai operasi I/O) kecuali ada executor yang melakukan poll. Ini berbeda "
"dari Promise JS, misalnya, yang akan berjalan hingga selesai bahkan jika "
"tidak pernah digunakan."

