msgid ""
"The [Flume](https://docs.rs/flume/latest/flume/) crate has channels that "
"implement both `sync` and `async` `send` and `recv`. This can be convenient "
"for complex applications with both IO and heavy CPU processing tasks."
msgstr ""
"Crate [Flume](https://docs.rs/flume/latest/flume/) memiliki channel yang "
"mengimplementasikan `send` dan `recv` secara `sync` maupun `async`. Ini "
"dapat memudahkan aplikasi kompleks yang memiliki task IO maupun pemrosesan "
"CPU berat."

#: src/concurrency/async-control-flow/channels.md
msgid ""
"What makes working with `async` channels preferable is the ability to "
"combine them with other `future`s to combine them and create complex control"
" flow."
msgstr ""
"Yang membuat channel `async` lebih disukai adalah kemampuan menggabungkannya"
" dengan `future` lain untuk menyatukan keduanya dan menciptakan alur kontrol"
" yang kompleks."

#: src/concurrency/async-control-flow/join.md
msgid ""
"A join operation waits until all of a set of futures are ready, and returns "
"a collection of their results. This is similar to `Promise.all` in "
"JavaScript or `asyncio.gather` in Python."
msgstr ""
"Operasi join menunggu hingga semua future dalam suatu rangkaian siap, dan "
"mengembalikan koleksi hasilnya. Ini serupa dengan `Promise.all` di "
"JavaScript atau `asyncio.gather` di Python."

