#: src/concurrency/async-control-flow/join.md
msgid ""
"For multiple futures of disjoint types, you can use `std::future::join!` but"
" you must know how many futures you will have at compile time. This is "
"currently in the `futures` crate, soon to be stabilised in `std::future`."
msgstr ""
"Untuk beberapa future dengan tipe yang saling lepas, Anda dapat menggunakan "
"`std::future::join!`, tetapi Anda harus mengetahui berapa banyak future yang"
" akan dimiliki pada waktu kompilasi. Saat ini fitur ini berada di crate "
"`futures`, dan akan segera distabilkan di `std::future`."

#: src/concurrency/async-control-flow/join.md
msgid ""
"The risk of `join` is that one of the futures may never resolve, this would "
"cause your program to stall."
msgstr ""
"Risiko `join` adalah salah satu future mungkin tidak pernah selesai; ini "
"akan menyebabkan program Anda macet."

#: src/concurrency/async-control-flow/join.md
msgid ""
"You can also combine `join_all` with `join!` for instance to join all "
"requests to an http service as well as a database query. Try adding a "
"`tokio::time::sleep` to the future, using `futures::join!`. This is not a "
"timeout (that requires `select!`, explained in the next chapter), but "
"demonstrates `join!`."
msgstr ""
"Anda juga dapat menggabungkan `join_all` dengan `join!`, misalnya untuk "
"menggabungkan semua permintaan ke layanan http serta kueri database. Coba "
"tambahkan `tokio::time::sleep` ke future, menggunakan `futures::join!`. Ini "
"bukan timeout (timeout memerlukan `select!`, dijelaskan pada bab "
"berikutnya), tetapi mendemonstrasikan `join!`."

#: src/concurrency/async-control-flow/select.md
msgid ""
"A select operation waits until any of a set of futures is ready, and "
"responds to that future's result. In JavaScript, this is similar to "
"`Promise.race`. In Python, it compares to `asyncio.wait(task_set, "
"return_when=asyncio.FIRST_COMPLETED)`."
msgstr ""
"Operasi select menunggu hingga salah satu future dalam suatu rangkaian siap,"
" lalu merespons hasil future tersebut. Di JavaScript, ini serupa dengan "
"`Promise.race`. Di Python, ini sebanding dengan `asyncio.wait(task_set, "
"return_when=asyncio.FIRST_COMPLETED)`."

#: src/concurrency/async-control-flow/select.md
msgid ""
"Similar to a match expression, the body of `select!` has a number of arms, "
"each of the form `pattern = future => expression`. When a `future` is ready,"
" its return value is destructured by the `pattern`. The `expression` is then"
" run with the resulting variables bound. The `expression` result becomes the"
" result of the `select!` macro."
msgstr ""
"Serupa dengan expression match, body `select!` memiliki sejumlah arm, "
"masing-masing berbentuk `pattern = future => expression`. Ketika `future` "
"siap, nilai kembaliannya di-destructure oleh `pattern`. `expression` "
"kemudian dijalankan dengan variabel hasil terikat. Hasil `expression` "
"menjadi hasil macro `select!`."

