msgstr "\"Slept for {} ms\""

#: src/concurrency/async-pitfalls/async-traits.md
msgid ""
"`async_trait` is easy to use, but note that it's using heap allocations to "
"achieve this. This heap allocation has performance overhead."
msgstr ""
"`async_trait` mudah digunakan, tetapi perhatikan bahwa crate ini menggunakan"
" alokasi heap untuk mencapainya. Alokasi heap ini memiliki overhead "
"performa."

#: src/concurrency/async-pitfalls/async-traits.md
msgid ""
