msgid ""
"Go through the methods in the example with the class and discuss what the "
"types of the functions should be."
msgstr ""
"Telusuri method dalam contoh bersama kelas dan diskusikan apa tipe fungsi "
"seharusnya."

#: src/idiomatic/foundations-api-design/predictable-api/naming-conventions/exercise.md
msgid ""
"Go through the unnamed methods and brainstorm what names those methods "
"should have."
msgstr ""
"Telusuri method yang belum bernama dan curahkan ide tentang nama yang "
"sebaiknya diberikan."

#: src/idiomatic/foundations-api-design/predictable-api/naming-conventions/exercise.md
