"`Rc::get_mut(&mut self /* &mut Rc<T> */) -> Option<&mut T>` (simplified)"
msgstr ""
"`Rc::get_mut(&mut self /* &mut Rc<T> */) -> Option<&mut T>` (disederhanakan)"

#: src/idiomatic/foundations-api-design/predictable-api/naming-conventions/exercise.md
