msgid "Diagram of valid transitions:"
msgstr "Diagram transisi yang valid:"

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-advanced.md
msgid ""
"Building on our previous serializer, we now want to support **nested "
"structures** and **lists**."
msgstr ""
"Melanjutkan serializer sebelumnya, sekarang kami ingin mendukung **struktur "
"bersarang** dan **list**."

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-advanced.md
msgid ""
"However, this introduces both **duplication** and **structural complexity**."
msgstr ""
"Namun, ini memperkenalkan **duplikasi** dan **kompleksitas struktural**."

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-advanced.md
msgid ""
"Even more critically, we now hit a **type system limitation**: we cannot "
"cleanly express what `finish()` should return without duplicating variants "
"for every nesting context (e.g. root, struct, list)."
msgstr ""
"Lebih kritis lagi, kami sekarang mencapai **keterbatasan sistem tipe**: kami"
" tidak dapat mengekspresikan dengan bersih apa yang harus dikembalikan "
"`finish()` tanpa menduplikasi varian untuk setiap konteks nesting (misalnya "
"root, struct, list)."

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-advanced.md
msgid "From the diagram of valid transitions, we can observe:"
msgstr "Dari diagram transisi yang valid, kami dapat mengamati:"

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-advanced.md
msgid "The transitions are recursive"
msgstr "Transisinya bersifat rekursif"

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-advanced.md
msgid "The return types depend on _where_ a substructure or list appears"
msgstr "Tipe kembalian bergantung pada _di mana_ substruktur atau list muncul"

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-advanced.md
msgid "Each context requires a return path to its parent"
msgstr "Setiap konteks memerlukan jalur kembali ke induknya"

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-advanced.md
msgid ""
"With only concrete types, this becomes unmanageable. Our current approach "
"leads to an explosion of types and manual wiring."
msgstr ""
"Dengan hanya tipe konkret, ini menjadi tidak terkelola. Pendekatan kami saat"
" ini menyebabkan ledakan tipe dan pengkabelan manual."

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-advanced.md
msgid ""
"In the next chapter, we’ll see how **generics** let us model recursive flows"
" with less boilerplate, while still enforcing valid operations at compile "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Pada bab berikutnya, kita akan melihat bagaimana **generic** memungkinkan "
"kita memodelkan alur rekursif dengan lebih sedikit boilerplate, sambil tetap"
" menegakkan operasi yang valid pada waktu kompilasi."

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-generics.md
msgid ""
"By combining typestate modeling with generics, we can express a wider range "
"of valid states and transitions without duplicating logic. This approach is "
"especially useful when the number of states grows or when multiple states "
"share behavior but differ in structure."
msgstr ""
"Dengan menggabungkan pemodelan typestate dengan generic, kita dapat "
"mengekspresikan berbagai state dan transisi valid yang lebih luas tanpa "
"menduplikasi logika. Pendekatan ini sangat berguna ketika jumlah state "
"bertambah atau ketika beberapa state berbagi perilaku tetapi berbeda "
"struktur."

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-generics.md
msgid ""
"We now have all the tools needed to implement the methods for the "
"`Serializer` and its state type definitions. This ensures that our API only "
"permits valid transitions, as illustrated in the following diagram:"
msgstr ""
"Kami sekarang memiliki semua alat yang diperlukan untuk mengimplementasikan "
"method bagi `Serializer` dan definisi tipe state-nya. Ini memastikan API "
"kami hanya mengizinkan transisi yang valid, seperti diilustrasikan pada "
"diagram berikut:"

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-generics.md
msgid ""
"By leveraging generics to track the parent context, we can construct "
"arbitrarily nested serializers that enforce valid transitions between "
"struct, list, and property states."
msgstr ""
"Dengan memanfaatkan generic untuk melacak konteks induk, kami dapat "
"membangun serializer bersarang secara arbitrer yang menegakkan transisi "
"valid antara state struct, list, dan property."

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-generics.md
msgid ""
"This enables us to build a recursive structure while maintaining strict "
"control over which methods are accessible in each state."
msgstr ""
"Ini memungkinkan kami membangun struktur rekursif sambil mempertahankan "
"kontrol ketat atas method mana yang dapat diakses pada setiap state."

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-generics.md
msgid ""
"Methods common to all states can be defined for any `S` in `Serializer<S>`."
msgstr ""
"Method yang umum pada semua state dapat didefinisikan untuk `S` apa pun pada"
" `Serializer<S>`."

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-generics.md
msgid ""
"Marker types (e.g., `List<S>`) introduce no memory or runtime overhead, as "
"they contain no data other than a possible Zero-Sized Type. Their only role "
"is to enforce correct API usage through the type system."
msgstr ""
"Marker type (misalnya, `List<S>`) tidak menimbulkan overhead memori atau "
"runtime, karena tidak berisi data selain kemungkinan Zero-Sized Type. "
"Perannya hanya menegakkan penggunaan API yang benar melalui sistem tipe."

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-generics/root.md
msgid ""
"Referring back to our original diagram of valid transitions, we can "
"visualize the beginning of our implementation as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Merujuk kembali ke diagram transisi valid awal kami, kami dapat "
"memvisualisasikan awal implementasi kami sebagai berikut:"

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-generics/root.md
msgid ""
"```bob\n"
"                          serialize\n"
"                          struct\n"
"+--------------------+ --------------> +----------------------------+\n"
"| \"Serializer<Root>\" |                 | \"Serializer<Struct<Root>>\" |\n"
"+--------------------+ <-------------- +----------------------------+\n"
"                         finish struct\n"
"         |\n"
"         |\n"
"         |\n"
"finish   |\n"
"         V\n"
"\n"
"     +--------+\n"
"     | String |\n"
"     +--------+\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```bob\n"
"                          serialize\n"
"                          struct\n"
"+--------------------+ --------------> +----------------------------+\n"
"| \"Serializer<Root>\" |                 | \"Serializer<Struct<Root>>\" |\n"
"+--------------------+ <-------------- +----------------------------+\n"
"                         finish struct\n"
"         |\n"
"         |\n"
"         |\n"
"finish   |\n"
"         V\n"
"\n"
"     +--------+\n"
"     | String |\n"
"     +--------+\n"
"```"

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-generics/root.md
msgid ""
"At the \"root\" of our `Serializer`, the only construct allowed is a "
"`Struct`."
msgstr ""
"Pada \"root\" `Serializer` kami, satu-satunya konstruk yang diizinkan adalah"
" `Struct`."

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-generics/root.md
msgid ""
"The `Serializer` can only be finalized into a `String` from this root level."
msgstr ""
"`Serializer` hanya dapat difinalisasi menjadi `String` dari tingkat root "
"ini."

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-generics/struct.md
msgid "\"{}{name}: \""
msgstr "\"{}{name}: \""

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-generics/struct.md
msgid "\"{}}}\""
msgstr "\"{}}}\""

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-generics/struct.md
msgid "The diagram can now be expanded as follows:"
msgstr "Diagram tersebut sekarang dapat diperluas sebagai berikut:"

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-generics/struct.md
msgid ""
"```bob\n"
"                                                     +------+\n"
"                                             finish  |      |\n"
"                          serialize          struct  V      |\n"
"                          struct\n"
"+--------------------+ --------------> +-------------------------+\n"
"| \"Serializer<Root>\" |                 | \"Serializer<Struct<S>>\" |\n"
"+--------------------+ <-------------- +-------------------------+\n"
"                         finish struct\n"
"         |                                     serialize   |\n"
"         |                                     property    V\n"
"         |\n"
"finish   |                           +-----------------------------------+\n"
"         V                           | \"Serializer<Property<Struct<S>>>\" |\n"
"                                     +-----------------------------------+\n"
"     +--------+\n"
"     | String |\n"
"     +--------+\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```bob\n"
"                                                     +------+\n"
"                                             finish  |      |\n"
"                          serialize          struct  V      |\n"
"                          struct\n"
"+--------------------+ --------------> +-------------------------+\n"
"| \"Serializer<Root>\" |                 | \"Serializer<Struct<S>>\" |\n"
"+--------------------+ <-------------- +-------------------------+\n"
"                         finish struct\n"
"         |                                     serialize   |\n"
"         |                                     property    V\n"
"         |\n"
"finish   |                           +-----------------------------------+\n"
"         V                           | \"Serializer<Property<Struct<S>>>\" |\n"
"                                     +-----------------------------------+\n"
"     +--------+\n"
"     | String |\n"
"     +--------+\n"
"```"

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-generics/struct.md
msgid "A `Struct` can only contain a `Property`;"
msgstr "`Struct` hanya dapat berisi `Property`;"

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-generics/struct.md
msgid ""
"Finishing a `Struct` returns control back to its parent, which in our "
"previous slide was assumed the `Root`, but in reality however it can be also"
" something else such as `Struct` in case of nested \"structs\"."
msgstr ""
"Menyelesaikan `Struct` mengembalikan kontrol ke induknya, yang pada slide "
"sebelumnya diasumsikan `Root`, tetapi dalam kenyataannya juga bisa sesuatu "
"yang lain seperti `Struct` dalam kasus \"struct\" bersarang."

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-generics/property.md
msgid "\"[\""
msgstr "\"[\""

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-generics/property.md
