"     +--------+                                list        V\n"
"\n"
"                                         +-----------------------+\n"
"                                         | \"Serializer<List<S>>\" |\n"
"                                         +-----------------------+\n"
"```"

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-generics/property.md
msgid ""
"A property can be defined as a `String`, `Struct<S>`, or `List<S>`, enabling"
" the representation of nested structures."
msgstr ""
"Property dapat didefinisikan sebagai `String`, `Struct<S>`, atau `List<S>`, "
"memungkinkan representasi struktur bersarang."

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-generics/property.md
msgid ""
"This concludes the step-by-step implementation. The full implementation, "
