"    // let results = db.results(); // ❌🔨\n"
msgstr ""
"// This won't compile because `db` is already mutably borrowed by `tx`.\n"
"    // let results = db.results(); // ❌🔨\n"

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/borrow-checker-invariants/aliasing-xor-mutability.md
msgid "// The borrow of `db` ends when `tx` is consumed by `commit()`.\n"
msgstr "// The borrow of `db` ends when `tx` is consumed by `commit()`.\n"

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/borrow-checker-invariants/aliasing-xor-mutability.md
msgid "// Now it is possible to borrow `db` again.\n"
msgstr "// Now it is possible to borrow `db` again.\n"

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/borrow-checker-invariants/aliasing-xor-mutability.md
msgid ""
"Motivation: In this database API queries are kicked off for asynchronous "
"execution and the results are only available once the whole transaction is "
"finished."
msgstr ""
"Motivasi: Dalam API database ini, kueri dijalankan untuk eksekusi asinkron "
"dan hasilnya hanya tersedia setelah seluruh transaksi selesai."

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/borrow-checker-invariants/aliasing-xor-mutability.md
msgid ""
"A user might think that queries are executed immediately, and try to read "
"results before they are made available. This API misuse could make the app "
"read incomplete or incorrect data."
msgstr ""
"Pengguna mungkin mengira kueri dieksekusi segera, dan mencoba membaca hasil "
"sebelum tersedia. Penyalahgunaan API ini dapat membuat aplikasi membaca data"
" yang tidak lengkap atau salah."

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/borrow-checker-invariants/aliasing-xor-mutability.md
msgid ""
"While an obvious misunderstanding, situations such as this can happen in "
"practice."
msgstr ""
"Meskipun kesalahpahaman yang jelas, situasi seperti ini dapat terjadi dalam "
"praktik."

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/borrow-checker-invariants/aliasing-xor-mutability.md
msgid ""
"Ask: Has anyone misunderstood an API by not reading the docs for proper use?"
msgstr ""
"Tanyakan: Adakah yang pernah salah memahami API karena tidak membaca "
"dokumentasi penggunaan yang benar?"

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/borrow-checker-invariants/aliasing-xor-mutability.md
msgid ""
"Expect: Examples of early-career or in-university mistakes and "
"misunderstandings."
msgstr ""
"Harapkan: Contoh kesalahan dan kesalahpahaman di awal karier atau semasa "
"kuliah."

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/borrow-checker-invariants/aliasing-xor-mutability.md
msgid ""
"As an API grows in size and user base, a smaller percentage of users has "
"deep knowledge of the system the API represents."
msgstr ""
"Saat API tumbuh dalam ukuran dan basis pengguna, persentase pengguna yang "
"memiliki pengetahuan mendalam tentang sistem yang direpresentasikan API "
"semakin kecil."

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/borrow-checker-invariants/aliasing-xor-mutability.md
msgid ""
"This example shows how we can use Aliasing XOR Mutability to prevent this "
"kind of misuse."
msgstr ""
"Contoh ini menunjukkan bagaimana kita dapat menggunakan Aliasing XOR "
"Mutability untuk mencegah penyalahgunaan semacam ini."

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/borrow-checker-invariants/aliasing-xor-mutability.md
msgid ""
"The code might read results before they are ready if the programmer assumes "
"that the queries execute immediately rather than kicked off for asynchronous"
" execution."
msgstr ""
"Kode mungkin membaca hasil sebelum siap jika programmer mengasumsikan kueri "
"dieksekusi segera, bukan dijalankan untuk eksekusi asinkron."

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/borrow-checker-invariants/aliasing-xor-mutability.md
msgid ""
"The constructor for the `Transaction` type takes a mutable reference to the "
"database connection, and stores it in the returned `Transaction` value."
msgstr ""
"Constructor tipe `Transaction` menerima reference mutable ke koneksi "
"database, dan menyimpannya dalam nilai `Transaction` yang dikembalikan."

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/borrow-checker-invariants/aliasing-xor-mutability.md
msgid ""
"The explicit lifetime here doesn't have to be intimidating, it just means "
"\"`Transaction` is outlived by the `DatabaseConnection` that was passed to "
"it\" in this case."
msgstr ""
"Lifetime eksplisit di sini tidak perlu menakutkan; dalam kasus ini artinya "
"hanya \"`Transaction` hidup lebih singkat daripada `DatabaseConnection` yang"
" diteruskan kepadanya\"."

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/borrow-checker-invariants/aliasing-xor-mutability.md
msgid ""
"The reference is mutable to completely lock out the `DatabaseConnection` "
"from other usage, such as starting further transactions or reading the "
"results."
msgstr ""
"Reference tersebut mutable untuk sepenuhnya mengunci `DatabaseConnection` "
"dari penggunaan lain, seperti memulai transaksi lebih lanjut atau membaca "
"hasil."

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/borrow-checker-invariants/aliasing-xor-mutability.md
msgid ""
"While a `Transaction` exists, we can't touch the `DatabaseConnection` "
"variable that was created from it."
msgstr ""
"Selama `Transaction` ada, kita tidak dapat menyentuh variabel "
"`DatabaseConnection` yang menjadi asalnya."

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/borrow-checker-invariants/aliasing-xor-mutability.md
msgid ""
"Demonstrate: uncomment the `db.results()` line. Doing so will result in a "
"compile error, as `db` is already mutably borrowed."
msgstr ""
"Demonstrasikan: buka komentar baris `db.results()`. Melakukannya akan "
"menghasilkan error kompilasi, karena `db` sudah dipinjam secara mutable."

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/borrow-checker-invariants/aliasing-xor-mutability.md
msgid ""
"Note: The query results not being public and placed behind a getter function"
" lets us enforce the invariant \"users can only look at query results if "
"there is no active transactions.\""
msgstr ""
"Catatan: Hasil kueri yang tidak publik dan ditempatkan di balik fungsi "
"getter memungkinkan kami menegakkan invariant \"pengguna hanya dapat melihat"
" hasil kueri jika tidak ada transaksi aktif.\""

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/borrow-checker-invariants/aliasing-xor-mutability.md
msgid ""
"If the query results were placed in a public struct field, this invariant "
"could be violated."
msgstr ""
"Jika hasil kueri ditempatkan pada field struct publik, invariant ini dapat "
"dilanggar."

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/borrow-checker-invariants/phantomdata-01-types.md
msgid "PhantomData 1/4: De-duplicating Same Data & Semantics"
msgstr "PhantomData 1/4: Menghapus Duplikasi Data & Semantik yang Sama"

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/borrow-checker-invariants/phantomdata-01-types.md
