msgstr "Berlatih Bekerja dengan unsafe"

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/welcome.md
msgid "reading and writing both code and documentation"
msgstr "membaca dan menulis kode maupun dokumentasi"

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/welcome.md
msgid "using unsafe APIs"
