msgstr "Rancang ulang sistem pemrosesan lanjutan agar bekerja tanpa `Drop`."

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/pinning/drop-and-not-unpin-worked-example.md
msgid "**Suggestion 1: Clone**"
msgstr "**Saran 1: Clone**"

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/pinning/drop-and-not-unpin-worked-example.md
msgid "Using `.clone()` is an obvious first choice, but it allocates memory."
msgstr ""
"Menggunakan `.clone()` adalah pilihan pertama yang jelas, tetapi "
"mengalokasikan memori."

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/pinning/drop-and-not-unpin-worked-example.md
