#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-interop.md
msgid ""
"This section of the course covers interacting with Rust and external "
"languages via its foreign-function interface (FFI), with a special focus on "
"interoperability with C++."
msgstr ""
"Bagian kursus ini membahas interaksi Rust dengan bahasa eksternal melalui "
"foreign-function interface (FFI), dengan fokus khusus pada interoperabilitas"
" dengan C++."

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-interop.md
msgid ""
"Ideally, users of Rust and the external language (in this case C++) could "
"call each others’ methods directly."
msgstr ""
"Idealnya, pengguna Rust dan bahasa eksternal (dalam hal ini C++) dapat "
"memanggil method satu sama lain secara langsung."

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-interop.md
msgid "This ideal scenario is very difficult to achieve:"
msgstr "Skenario ideal ini sangat sulit dicapai:"

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-interop.md
msgid ""
"Different languages have different semantics and mapping between them "
"implies trade-offs Neither Rust nor C++ offer ABI stability[^1], making it "
"difficult to build from a stable foundation"
msgstr ""
"Bahasa berbeda memiliki semantik berbeda dan pemetaan di antaranya "
"menimbulkan trade-off. Baik Rust maupun C++ tidak menawarkan stabilitas "
"ABI[^1], sehingga sulit membangun dari fondasi yang stabil"

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-interop.md
msgid ""
"Some C++ compiler vendors provide support for ABI stability within their "
"toolchain."
msgstr ""
"Sebagian vendor compiler C++ menyediakan dukungan stabilitas ABI dalam "
"toolchain mereka."

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/strategies.md
msgid "Strategies of interop"
msgstr "Strategi Interop"

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/strategies.md
msgid "Sharing data structures and symbols directly is very difficult:"
msgstr "Berbagi struktur data dan simbol secara langsung sangat sulit:"

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/strategies.md
msgid "FFI through the C ABI is much more feasible:"
msgstr "FFI melalui ABI C jauh lebih layak:"

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/strategies.md
#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences.md
msgid ""
"````````bob\n"
"╭────────────╮          ╭───╮           ╭───╮          ╭────────────╮\n"
"│            │          │   │           │   │          │            │\n"
"│            │ <----->  │   │ <~~~~~~~> │   │ <------> │            │ \n"
"│            │          │   │           │   │          │            │\n"
"╰────────────╯          ╰───╯           ╰───╯          ╰────────────╯\n"
"    Rust                  C               C                 \"C++\"\n"
"````````"
msgstr ""
"````````bob\n"
"╭────────────╮          ╭───╮           ╭───╮          ╭────────────╮\n"
"│            │          │   │           │   │          │            │\n"
"│            │ <----->  │   │ <~~~~~~~> │   │ <------> │            │ \n"
"│            │          │   │           │   │          │            │\n"
"╰────────────╯          ╰───╯           ╰───╯          ╰────────────╯\n"
"    Rust                  C               C                 \"C++\"\n"
"````````"

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/strategies.md
msgid "Other strategies:"
msgstr "Strategi lain:"

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/strategies.md
msgid "Distributed system (RPC)"
msgstr "Sistem terdistribusi (RPC)"

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/strategies.md
msgid "Custom ABI (i.e. WebAssembly Interface Types)"
msgstr "ABI khusus (yaitu WebAssembly Interface Types)"

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/strategies.md
msgid "_High-fidelity interop_"
msgstr "_Interop high-fidelity_"

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/strategies.md
msgid "The ideal scenario is currently experimental."
msgstr "Skenario ideal saat ini bersifat eksperimental."

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/strategies.md
msgid ""
"Two projects exploring this are [crubit](https://github.com/google/crubit) "
"and [Zngur](https://hkalbasi.github.io/zngur/). The first provides glue code"
" on each side for enabling compatible types to work seamlessly across "
"domains. The second relies on dynamic dispatch and imports C++ objects into "
"Rust as trait objects."
msgstr ""
"Dua proyek yang mengeksplorasi ini adalah "
"[crubit](https://github.com/google/crubit) dan "
"[Zngur](https://hkalbasi.github.io/zngur/). Proyek pertama menyediakan kode "
"glue di setiap sisi agar tipe yang kompatibel bekerja mulus lintas domain. "
"Proyek kedua mengandalkan dynamic dispatch dan mengimpor objek C++ ke Rust "
"sebagai trait object."

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/strategies.md
msgid "_Low-fidelity interop_ work through a C API"
msgstr "_Interop low-fidelity_ bekerja melalui API C"

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/strategies.md
msgid ""
"The typical strategy for interop is to use the C language as the interface. "
"C is a lossy codec. This strategy typically results in complicated code on "
"both sides."
msgstr ""
"Strategi interop yang umum adalah menggunakan bahasa C sebagai antarmuka. C "
"adalah codec lossy. Strategi ini biasanya menghasilkan kode rumit di kedua "
"sisi."

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/strategies.md
msgid "_Other strategies_ are less viable in a zero cost environment."
msgstr "_Strategi lain_ kurang layak dalam lingkungan zero cost."

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/strategies.md
msgid "_Distributed systems_ impose runtime costs."
msgstr "_Sistem terdistribusi_ menimbulkan biaya runtime."

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/strategies.md
msgid ""
"They incur significant overhead as calling a method in a foreign library "
"incurs a round trip of serialization/transport/deserialization. Generally "
"speaking, a transparent RPC is not a good idea. There’s network in the "
"middle."
msgstr ""
"Mereka menimbulkan overhead signifikan karena memanggil method di library "
"asing menimbulkan round trip serialisasi/transportasi/deserialisasi. Secara "
"umum, RPC transparan bukan ide bagus. Ada jaringan di antaranya."

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/strategies.md
msgid ""
"_Custom ABI_, such as wasm require a runtime or significant implementation "
"cost."
msgstr ""
"_ABI khusus_, seperti wasm, memerlukan runtime atau biaya implementasi "
"signifikan."

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences.md
msgid ""
"Using C as the lowest common denominator means that lots of the richness "
"available to Rust and C++ is lost."
msgstr ""
"Menggunakan C sebagai penyebut terkecil berarti banyak kekayaan yang "
"tersedia bagi Rust dan C++ hilang."

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences.md
msgid ""
"Each translation has the potential for semantic loss, runtime overhead, and "
"subtle bugs."
msgstr ""
"Setiap terjemahan berpotensi mengalami kehilangan semantik, overhead "
"runtime, dan bug halus."

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/representations.md
msgid "b\"Hello, C\\0\""
msgstr "b\"Hello, C\\0\""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/representations.md
msgid "b\"Hello, C++\\0\""
msgstr "b\"Hello, C++\\0\""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/representations.md
msgid "b\"Hello, Rust\""
msgstr "b\"Hello, Rust\""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/representations.md
msgid ""
"Each language has its own opinion about how to implement things, which can "
"lead to confusion and bugs. Consider three ways to represent text."
msgstr ""
"Setiap bahasa memiliki pendapat sendiri tentang cara mengimplementasikan "
"sesuatu, yang dapat menyebabkan kebingungan dan bug. Pertimbangkan tiga cara"
" merepresentasikan teks."

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/representations.md
msgid "Show how to convert the raw representations to a Rust string slice:"
msgstr ""
"Tunjukkan cara mengonversi representasi mentah menjadi string slice Rust:"

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/representations.md
msgid "// C representation to Rust\n"
msgstr "// C representation to Rust\n"

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/representations.md
msgid "\"{c}\""
msgstr "\"{c}\""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/representations.md
msgid "// C++ representation to Rust \n"
msgstr "// C++ representation to Rust \n"

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/representations.md
msgid "\"{cc}\""
msgstr "\"{cc}\""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/representations.md
msgid "// Rust representation (bytes) to string slice\n"
msgstr "// Rust representation (bytes) to string slice\n"

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/representations.md
msgid "\"{rust}\""
msgstr "\"{rust}\""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/representations.md
msgid ""
"Aside: Rust has a c-prefixed string literal. It appends a null byte at the "
"end, e.g. `c\"Rust\" == b\"Rust\\0\"`."
msgstr ""
"Catatan samping: Rust memiliki string literal berprefiks c. Literal ini "
"menambahkan byte null di akhir, misalnya `c\"Rust\" == b\"Rust\\0\"`."

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/semantics.md
msgid "/// Create a formatted time based on timestamp `t`.\n"
msgstr "/// Create a formatted time based on timestamp `t`.\n"

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/semantics.md
msgid ""
"// SAFETY: `seconds` is generated by the system clock and will not cause\n"
"    // overflow\n"
msgstr ""
"// SAFETY: `seconds` is generated by the system clock and will not cause\n"
"    // overflow\n"

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/semantics.md
msgid "// SAFETY: ctime returns a pointer to a preallocated (non-null) buffer\n"
msgstr ""
"// SAFETY: ctime returns a pointer to a preallocated (non-null) buffer\n"

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/semantics.md
msgid "// SAFETY: ctime uses valid UTF-8\n"
msgstr "// SAFETY: ctime uses valid UTF-8\n"

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/semantics.md
msgid "\"{t:?}\""
msgstr "\"{t:?}\""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/semantics.md
msgid ""
"Some constructs that other languages allow cannot be expressed in the Rust "
"language."
msgstr ""
"Beberapa konstruk yang diizinkan bahasa lain tidak dapat diekspresikan dalam"
" bahasa Rust."

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/semantics.md
msgid ""
"The `ctime` function modifies an internal buffer shared between calls. This "
"cannot be represented as Rust’s lifetimes."
msgstr ""
"Fungsi `ctime` memodifikasi buffer internal yang dibagikan antarpemanggilan."
" Ini tidak dapat direpresentasikan sebagai lifetime Rust."

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/semantics.md
msgid "`'static` does not apply, as the semantics are different"
msgstr "`'static` tidak berlaku, karena semantiknya berbeda"

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/semantics.md
msgid "`'a` does not apply, as the buffer outlives each call"
msgstr ""
"`'a` tidak berlaku, karena buffer hidup lebih lama dari setiap pemanggilan"

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/rust-and-c.md
#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/cpp-and-c.md
#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/language-differences/rust-and-cpp.md
msgid "Concern"
msgstr "Aspek"

